<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">MARKO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc1">MARKO NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARKO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NZƐMBA</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bd">Marko</char> yeɛ ɔhworɔle nzɛmba he ɔ, na ye de, né ɔbokka Yesu asomafoɛ naso. Yeti wannya ye nwo atee wannwu nningyein bɔ Yesu yɛle nanu pee. Nakoso ɔne Somafoɛ Paul ne Somafoɛ Petro natele paa. Na ɔbokale Paul ne Barnaba mmerɛ bɔ ne bɛyɛ bɛ som adwuma ne. Ɛhe maa otule atee hɔle Babilon ne Roman po.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mmerɛ bɔ Marko wɔ Roman kɔyɛ afoɛ 60 kosi 65<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afoɛ namukoraati te Yɛ Aberɛ So (Y.A) Brɔfo Common Era ana C.E.</char></note> nanu berɛ ne, yeɛ ɔhworɔle Yesu nwo dwirɛ ɔ, na ye si ne, bɛfa bɛbokale Bible naso. Sɛ ɛnea nzɛmba nna ne a, ye deɛ ne yeɛ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ɔ. Ɛkora nwu kyɛ edwirɛ bɔ ɔhworɔle ne, onyane enu pee nala fili Petro berɛ. Petro de, ɔfale ye nye nwuni nningyein bɔ Yesu yɛle namu. Marko anga Yesu aworɛ ne ye ngwalaa nu dwirɛ biala kyɛbɔ Mateo yɛle ne, ye de ɔhyɛle yebo fili Yesu asubɔ naso wɔ afoɛ 29 Y.A kosi ye tingyele naso wɔ afoɛ 33 Y.A. — <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-9">Mar 1:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">16:1-8</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Marko andworɔ ye nzɛmba ne amma Yudafoɛ, bɛ bɔ ne bɛ nwo adwene wɔ ye ti anu paa yeɛ ole Romanfoɛ. Yeti ne okyirekyire Yudafoɛ amammerɛ ne bɛ dwirɛ biemɔ nu kɔ siɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ne Romanfoɛ nemɔ kɔte Yudafoɛ amammerɛ ne bɛ nneyɛɛ nemɔ bo ɔ. Marko nzɛmba ne yeɛ ɔte sii koraa wɔ nzɛmba nna nanu ɔ. Na ye dwirɛ ne pee nala wɔ berɛ a, ofite nzɛmba nza bɔ waha nanu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Marko nzɛmba ne maa yɛnwu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yesu yeɛ ole Mezaya bɔ ne bɛnea ye ate ne, na ye yeɛ ole Nyameɛ Awa ne.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yesu ala yeɛ ole Sona Awa ne, na Nyameɛ afa nikye biala awura ye sa.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né odikyɛ Sona Awa ne nwu amaneɛ, na owu.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Yesu hane Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ ɔhɔle so kora yeɛ Yesu hyɛ ye asɛnka adwuma nabo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu asɛnka adwuma né ahyɛaseɛ wɔ Galilea (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-3:35">1:14–3:35</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu fale mvandoho yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:1-34">4:1-34</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu yɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee wɔ Galilea ɛpo ne ye mandanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:35-5:43">4:35–5:43</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesu trɛle ye asɛnka adwuma nanu hɔle nekaa foforɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 6:1-9:50">6:1–9:50</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adwuma bɔ Yesu yɛle ye w Perea ne Yeriko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 10:1-52">10:1-52</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Asɛnka adwuma bɔ Yesu yɛle ye wɔ Yerusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-14:16">11:1–14:16</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ ɔhɔle so mmerɛ bɔ né waha kaa maa Yesu wu ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 14:37-15:41">14:37–15:41</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ye sielɛ ne ye tingyelɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 15:42-16:8">15:42–16:8</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Awieɛ dwirɛ sii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:8">16:8</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Awieɛ dwirɛ tendee (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16:9-20</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Nyameɛ awa Yesu Kristo nwo nzɛmba né ahyɛaseɛ, <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />kyɛbɔ ɔwɔ diifoɛ Isaiah nwomaa nanu ne. Ɔhworɔle kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Nea, mesoma me bɔfoɛ maa odi wɔ nyunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">ye yeɛ okosiesie atee nu kɔma wɔ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“Ebie tea nu wɔ ɛserɛ naso kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Ɛmɔsiesie Awurade atee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Ɛmɔma ye atee ne tengyɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Né Yohane Suboniɛ wɔ ɛserɛ so, ná ne ɔka kyire mmenia kyɛ, bɛbɔ asu bɛfa behyire kyɛ basakra b'adwene, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔfa bɛ bɔne bɛkɔhyɛ bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛtete Yerusalem ne Yudea namukoraati hɔle ye berɛ, na bɛhane bɛ bɔne maa ɔbɔle bɛ asu wɔ Yordan nzue nanu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Atadeɛ bɔ owura Yohane ne, afunum nwiaa yeɛ né bafa bayɛ ɔ, na né wafa kaka nwomaa wayɛ ye bɛlɛt.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Abɔsoɛ.”</char></note> Mmɛbɛ ne woɛ yeɛ ne odi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Na ɔhyɛle yebo hane kyɛ: “Ebie li me si ɔba, na ole tumi tra me, ye mmaboa nyamaa po, menvata kyɛ me sangye. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nzue yeɛ mefa mebɔ ɛmɔ asu ɔ, nakoso ye de, honhom krongron yeɛ ɔkɔfa kɔbɔ ɛmɔ asu ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Sɔ mmerɛ nanu ne, Yesu fili Nazerɛt bɔ ɔwɔ Galilea ne wale Yohane berɛ maa ɔbɔle ye asu wɔ Yordan nu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ofili nzue ne bo fitele nala pɛ, onwuni kyɛ anwuro abukye, ná honhom krongron ne ba ye so te kyɛ abubure. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Na konviɛ teane nu wɔ anwuro kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle mma bɔ medɔ ye ne, male wɔ mato nu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Na ndɛ nala, honhom ne fale ye hɔle ɛserɛ so, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />ɔtenane ɛserɛ naso ngyẽa 40, na Abɔnzam sɔle ye neane. Ngaka bɔ bɛ nwo yɛ suro yeɛ né ɔne wɔ berɛ ɔ, nakoso abɔfo wala bɛɛbokale ye.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Bɛhyele Yohane ne, Yesu hɔle Galilea ɔɔhane nzɛmba bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ɔhane kyɛ: “Mmerɛ bɔ bɛhyɛle ne aso, na Nyameɛ Ahennie né apingye. Ɛmɔsakra ɛmɔ adwene na ɛmɔle nzɛmba ne bɛli.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu nate Galilea po ne noa ne, onwuni kyɛ Simon ne oliema Andrea gua bɛ nɛt wɔ ɛpo nanu, ofikyɛ né bɛkye egyein. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔɔli me si, na ngɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔhye mmenia.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Na ɛberɛ ala, bɛyakyile bɛ nɛt ne berɛ bɛlili ye si.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ɔhɔle ye nyunu kaa ne, onwuni Sebedeo awa Yakobo ne oliema Yohane. Né bɛne bɛ baba te ɛlɛen nu bɛpomba bɛ nɛt. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Na ɛberɛ ala ɔfrɛle bɛ, na bɛyakyile bɛ baba Sebedeo ne apaafoɛ nemɔ wɔ ɛlɛen na nu, na bɛlili ye si.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu ne bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne hɔle Kapernaum, na odwuli homeda ne, ɔhɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na ɔhyɛle yebo kyɛ okyirekyire. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ná ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne yɛle bɛ nwanwa, ofikyɛ ne okyirekyire bɛ kyɛ ebie bɔ ole tumi, ɔtte kyɛ atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Né biaa bie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so wɔ berɛ, na ɔteane nu kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu, nzu yeɛ yafa yayɛ wɔ ɔ?<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nzu yeɛ ɔwɔ yɛne wɔ afia ɔ?”</char></note> Awa kyɛ ɛbaasɛkye yɛ hɔ? Mese wɔ, wɔ yeɛ ɛte Krongroniɛ bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Nakoso, Yesu teane ye kyɛ: “Yɛ konn, na fi ye nu!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Na sunzummɔne ne maa biaa ne senzene, ɔteane nu serɛ-serɛ, na ofili ye nu. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ɛhe yɛle mmenia ne nwanwa, na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛbisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nzu ane? Ɛhe te ngyerɛkyerɛ foforɛ hɔ? Ɔfa tumi dwudwo kyire sunzummɔne mɔ po maa betie ye.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Na Yesu nwo dwirɛ trɛle ndɛ-ndɛ hɔle Galilea mandanu berɛ mukoraati.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Na Yesu ne Yakobo ne Yohane fili sua nanu, na bɛhɔle Simon ne Andrea awuro. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Né <char style="tl">fiiva</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ebunu.”</char></note> ahye Simon sia ato berɛ, na bɛhane ye nwo dwirɛ behyirele Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yeti ɔhɔle ye nwo berɛ, na ɔsɔle ye sa nu maa odwɔsole, na <char style="tl">fiiva</char> ne hɔle. Na maame ne hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɔsõ ye.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Sɔ kyẽa ne nnɔsoa, eyia né tɔle ne, bɛfale bɛ bɔ bafokyɛ ne bɛ bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ bɛ so bɛbrɛle ye; <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />na kuro nanufoɛ mukoraati boale bɛ nwo noa wɔ anoa ne nyunu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yeti, ɔsale bɛ bɔ anwonyerɛ pee ha bɛ ne anwonyerɛ, na otuli sunzummɔne pee, nakoso, wamma sunzummɔne nemɔ andwudwo, ofikyɛ ne bɛse kyɛ yeɛ ole Kristo ne.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu bɔ ewienu tettele ne, Yesu dwɔsole, na oowurale nekaa bie konn bɔle mbaeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simon ne bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne penane ye, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />na mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni ye ne, bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ebiala pena wɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yɛhɔ nekaa foforɛ, yɛhɔ nguro bɔ wapɛ yɛ nwo wayia nanu, na ngɔnga edwirɛ ne wɔ berɛ, ofikyɛ ɛhe ati yeɛ mmale ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Yeti, ohyinini Galilea mukoraati, ɔyɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nemɔ nu, na otuli sunzummɔne pee.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Na kwataniɛ bie wale Yesu berɛ, na obuli ndwerɛ srɛle ye kyɛ: “Sɛ ekuro a, ɛkɔhora kɔmaa me nwo kɔtɔ me.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Kɔte”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Edwirɛ ne yɛle ye aworabɔ, yeti ɔtengyɛle ye sa sɔle ye nu, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Mekuro, wɔ nwo tɔ wɔ”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Wɔ nwo te”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Na ɛberɛ ala, kwata ne hɔle, na biaa ne nwo tɔle ye. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Ɛberɛ ala, Yesu maa ɔhɔle, na ɔhyɛle ye kitii kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Nea na ammɔ so angyire ebiala, nakoso kɔ, na kɔfa wɔ nwo kyire sɔfo nemɔ. Na ɔnate kyɛ wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ nati, fa akyɛdeɛ bɔ Mose hane ne ma bɛ, na ɔyɛ adanzeɛ ma bɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Nakoso biaa ne hɔle ne, ɔhane ye nwo dwirɛ hyirele ebiala. Ɛhe ati, né Yesu ngora nye ye nyunu ngɔ kuro biala nu, mmom, ɔtele ye nwo tenane nekaa bie wɔ kuro ne si. Nakoso, mmenia fili nekaa pee wale ye berɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ngyẽa bie si ne, Yesu sa hɔle Kapernaum, na mmenia tele kyɛ ɔwɔ awuro. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Yeti, mmeni pee wale awuro berɛ, né bɛsone pa-pa, yeti né bɛngɔ aluo berɛ po, na ɔhyɛle yebo hane edwirɛ ne hyirele bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Né mmrienzua nná bie fa bubuaniɛ bie brɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Nakoso mmenia nati, né bennya atee po né bawa nekaa bɔ Yesu wɔ ne, yeti bɛtuli sua naso wɔ Yesu ti afia berɛ, na bɛtuli nu tokuro. Afei bɛdwurale bɛen bɔ bubuaniɛ ne la so ne. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu nwuni bɛ gyidie ne, ɔha hyirele bubuaniɛ ne kyɛ: “Mma, bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Né atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ bie te berɛ, na ne bɛdwene ye nwo wɔ bɛ ti anu kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Edwirɛ beni yeɛ akoaa he ka ne? Wabɔ mmusue! Nná Nyameɛ ngome yeɛ ɔkora fa bɔne kyɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Na ɛberɛ ala, Yesu nate ye honhom naso nwuni kyɛ, sɔ dwirɛ ne yeɛ bɛdwene ye nwo wɔ b'ahone nu ɔ, yeti obisale kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔdwene ɛhe anwo wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu ne? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Beni yeɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ɔ, kyɛ bɛkɔha bɛkohyire bubuaniɛ ne kyɛ, ‘Bafa wɔ bɔne bahyɛ wɔ,’ anaa bɛkɔha kyɛ, ‘Dwɔso, fa wɔ bɛen, na nate’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Na bɔ ɔkɔyɛ na ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ, sona Awa ne le tumi wɔ aseɛ he aso kyɛ ɔkora fa bɔne kyɛ nati,” ɔha hyirele bubuaniɛ ne kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, ‘Dwɔso, fa wɔ bɛen, na kɔ w'awuro.’” <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ná ɛberɛ ala odwɔsole fale ye bɛen, na ɔnatele maa ebiala nwuni ye. Edwirɛ ne yɛle bɛ mukoraati nwanwa, na bɛhyɛle Nyameɛ anuonyam kyɛ: “Ɛhe de, yɛnwuni bie lle.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Afei, Yesu hɔle ɛpo ne noa dɔ, na mmeni pee sa wale ye nwo berɛ, na ohyirehyirele bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ɔpɛ nu ne, onwuni Alfeo awa Lewi kyɛ ɔte nekaa bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne, na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baali me si.” Na ɛberɛ ala, odwɔso lili ye si.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Yesi ne, mmerɛ bɔ odidi wɔ Lewi awuro ne, né bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne abɔnefoɛ pee wɔ berɛ, na ne bɛne Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ ne didi. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Atwerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛte Farisifoɛ nemɔ nwuni kyɛ Yesu ne sɔ mmenia nemɔ didi ne, bɛbisale ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛdide toɔ ne abɔnefoɛ to asaa didi ne?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu tele ɛhe ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɛ bɔ bɛte apɔ ne, benhia dɔktaniɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne yeɛ behia dɔktaniɛ ɔ. Nná ateneneefoɛ ti yeɛ mmale ɔ, mmale kyɛ mebaafrɛ abɔnefoɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Yohane asuafoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ yɛ akɔngyere. Yeti ebiemɔ bisale Yesu kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ w'asuafoɛ nemɔ nnyɛ akɔngyere kyɛbɔ Yohane asuafoɛ ne Farisifoɛ nemɔ yɛ ne?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne nnamvo nemɔ ayɛ akɔngyere, mmerɛ bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ nwo wa ne? Brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne wɔ bɛ nwo ne ngome de, bɛngɔhora bɛngɔhye hɔen. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Nakoso mmerɛ bie kɔwa, bɔ bɛkɔfa brienzua bɔ ɔbaagya ne bɛkɔhɔ, sɔ mmerɛ ne de, bɛkɔyɛ akɔngyere. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa ɛtena monɛ ta atadeɛ daa nu ɔ. Sɛ ɔyɛ sɔ a, ɛtena monɛ ne kɔte kofi daa nanu, na atadeɛ ne kɔte piri paa kɔtra daa ne. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Afei koso, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa nzãa foforɛ gua nzãa bɔtɔ daa nu ɔ. Sɛ ɔyɛ sɔ a, nzãa ne kɔpakye bɔtɔ ne, maa nzãa ne kohwie kogua, ná bɔtɔ ne koso kɔsɛkye. Yeti bɛfa nzãa foforɛ bɛgua nzãa bɔtɔ monɛ nu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Homeda bie, né Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ nate hwiit boo bie nu, na asuafoɛ nemɔ kɔ ne, bɛhyɛle yebo kyɛ bɛtete hwiit ne bie. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Yeti, Farisifoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea nikye! Nzuati yeɛ w'asuafoɛ nemɔ yɛ nikye bɔ mmeraa mma atee kyɛ bɛyɛ ye homeda ne?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ye koso ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ David yɛle, mmerɛ bɔ ne ye nwo ahyere ye, ná ɛhɔen ku ɔne ye mmrandeɛ nemɔ ne, ɛmɔ kenngale? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Mmerɛ bɔ né Abiata te Sɔfo panyi, David hɔle Nyameɛ awuro berɛ, na olili paanoo bɔ bafa bawa Nyameɛ nyunu ne, na ɔfale bie koso mane bɛ bɔ ne bɛboka ye so ne. Sɔ paanoo ne, né mmeraa mma ate kyɛ ebiala di, sana sɔfo nemɔ ngome.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Ná Yesu sa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sona ti yeɛ bɛyɛle homeda a, na nná homeda ti yeɛ bɛbɔle sona ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Yeti, Sona Awa ne yeɛ ɔte homeda ne wura ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Osa hɔle sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, né biaa bie bɔ ye sa awu wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ɔnate kyɛ né bɛpena Yesu bɛbɔ ye sommoɛ nati, né bɛnea paa sɛ ɔkɔsa biaa ne anwonyerɛ Homeda a. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu ha hyirele biaa bɔ ye sa awu ne kyɛ: “Dwɔso bagyina afia wa.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ mmeraa ma ate kyɛ bɛyɛ ye Homeda ɔ, nikye pa anaa nikye tɛɛ? Kyɛ bɛkole ebie ngoa anaa bɛkɔhu ebie?” Nakoso, bandwudwo. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Na Yesu fale ɛyaa neane bɛ mukoraati yiale, na b'ahone bɔ ɔyɛ se nati, né ye wora abɔ ama bɛ. Yeti, ɔha hyirele biaa ne kyɛ: “Tengyɛ wɔ sa nanu.” Na ɔtengyɛle ye sa nanu, na ye sa ne yɛle yé. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Yeti, Farisifoɛ nemɔ fite hɔle, na bɛne bɛ bɔ bɛta Herode si<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Herodifoɛ.”</char></note> ne bɔle ye nwo porɛ, né bɛpena atee bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔhu ye.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Na Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fili berɛ hɔle ɛpo ne noa dɔ, na mmeni pee fili Galilea ne Yudea lili ye si. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Né ebiemɔ po fi Yerusalem, Yudea, Idumea, ne Yordan nzue ne si dɔ, na ne ebiemɔ koso fi nguro bɔ ɔwɔ Tiro ne Sidon nanu. Sɔ mmenia nemɔ tele nningyein mbiri-mbiri bɔ ne ɔyɛ ne, yeti bɛfili dɔ bɛwale ye berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yesu ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ, bɛpena ɛleɛn bie ma ɔtena nu, ná mmenia ne ammɔ ye so. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ɔsale mmeni pee anwonyerɛ, yeti bɛ bɔ bɛnde apɔ ne piane bɛ nwo wii wale ye so kyɛ bɛbaasɔ ye nu. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na sɛ sunzummɔne mɔ po nwu ye a, ne bɛfi ase wɔ ye nyunu bɛteɛtea nu kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ele Nyameɛ awa ne!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Nakoso, né ɔtaa hyɛ bɛ kyɛ, bɛnea yé na bamma ebiala anwu sona deinn bɔ ɔte ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesi ne, Yesu hɔle bokaa naso, na ɔfrɛle bɛ bɔ ɔpena bɛ ne maa bɛwale ye nwo berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ɔyele bɛ nu 12 yɛle bɛ kue kõ, na ɔfrɛle bɛ asomafoɛ. Bɛ yeɛ ne bɛkoli ye si, na bɛ yeɛ né ɔkɔsoma bɛ maa bɛkɔɔha nzɛmba ne, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na ne ɔkɔma bɛ tumi bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔtu sunzummɔne. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Sɔ 12 ne ɛhe: Simon, ye yeɛ osa frɛle ye Petro ne, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Sebedeo awa Yohane, ne oliema Yakobo, (bɛ yeɛ ɔfrɛle bɛ <char style="tl">Boa-ner-ges</char>, bɔ okyire “Agralaa mmaa” ne), <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andrea, Filipo, Bartolomeo, Mateo, Tomas, Alfeo awa Yakobo, Tadeo, Simon bɔ ofi Kanaan,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Simon bɔ ɔbɔ ye nwo mmɔden,” ofikyɛ bɔ Kanaan ne kyire yeɛ ole ebie bɔ ɔbɔ ye nwo mmɔden.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ɔne Yuda Iskariot bɔ ɔyele ye mane ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:19">Yesu hɔle awuro bie nu, <verse eid="MRK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />ná mmeni pee sa pɛle ye nwo yiale, yeti, ɔne ye asuafoɛ ne anya atee po annidi. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Mmerɛ bɔ ye abusuafoɛ ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛhɔle kyɛ bɛkwaahye ye, na ne bɛka kyɛ: “Gyemia ye adwene nyɛ adwuma.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Afei koso, atwerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛfi Yerusalem bɛwale ne hane kyɛ: “Ole Beelsebul, na sunzummɔne panyi ne tumi, yeɛ ɔfa tu sunzummɔne ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yeti, Yesu frɛle bɛ, na ɔyɛle mvandoho hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne Satan atu Satan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Sɛ ahennie bie ne ye nwo kõ a, sɔ ahennie ne gu; <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />na sɛ awuro bie ne ye nwo kõ a, sɔ awuro ne ngogyina. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Yeti, sɛ Satan dwɔso tia ye nwo, na ɔkõ tia ye nwo a, ɔngɔhora gyina; mmom ye awieɛ yeɛ ne ɔba ne. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔhɔ kwabranoa bie awuro kɔɔwia ye nningyein; sana odi moa kyekye kwabranoa ne kora, né wahora wasesa ye nningyein ne.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɔne biala bɔ sona kɔyɛ, anaa mmusue dwirɛ biala bɔ sona kɔha ne, bɛkɔfa bɛkɔhyɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Nakoso, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔha mmusue dwirɛ kotia honhom krongron ne de, bɛngɔfa bɛngɔhyɛ ye lle. Okoli sɔ bɔne nanwo fɔ daa.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu hane sɔ dwirɛ he, ofikyɛ ne bɛka kyɛ: “Ole honhommɔne.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Yesu maame ne oliema mmrienzua nemɔ wale bɛɛgyinane aluo dɔ, na bɛsoma ebie kyɛ ɔfrɛ ye ma bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Né mmeni pee apɛ ye nwo ayia, yeti, bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Nea, wɔ maame ne eliema mɔ gyi aluo dɔ, bɛnwa ɛbra.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Nakoso, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ole me maame ne nniema mɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Afei, ɔneane bɛ bɔ bapɛ ye nwo bayia namukoraati, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Me maame ne nniema mɔ yeɛ bɛtete wa ne. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ne, ɔte nniema brienzua, nniema brasua, ne me maame.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu sa hyɛle yebo yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ ɛpo ne noa, na mmeni pee wale ye nwo berɛ. Yeti, ɔfole ɛleɛn bie tenane nu wɔ ɛpo naso, na mmenia ne koso tenane ɛpo ne noa. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Na ɔfale mvandoho hane edwirɛ pee hyirele bɛ, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Ɛmɔtie, kuaniɛ bie hɔle kyɛ ɔkwaagua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔkwaapete.”</char></note> ɛmo. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Ogua ne, ebie guale atee noa, na nnomaa susole. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ebie guale nyɔboɛ so, né nnɛterɛ pee nne berɛ, yeti ofifili, nakoso ɔnate kyɛ nnɛterɛ pee nne berɛ nati, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />mmerɛ bɔ eyia bɔle ne, ɔyerale ofikyɛ né olle ndii. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mmaa ne bie guale mmowie nu, na mmowie ne nyi miane ne, yeti wanzu mmaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Nakoso ebie guale aseɛ pa so, na ofifili, onyini, na osuli mmaa. Ebie suli 30, ebie suli 60, yeɛ ebie suli 100.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ɔhale ye ngome ne, bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne asuafoɛ buru-ne-nyɔ ne bisale ye bɔ mvandoho ne kyire ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ yeɛ bafa bama ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔte Nyameɛ Ahennie nanwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea nabo, bɛ bɔ baha ne de, mvandoho yeɛ bɛfa bekyirekyire nikye biala nu bɛkyire bɛ ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />yeti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘bɛnea de, nakoso bɛnnwu ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">na betie, nakoso bɛnde yebo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ná bɛngɔsakra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">maa bɛngɔfa bɛ bɔne bɛngɔhyɛ bɛ.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu sa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔnde yebo, ye de, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ na ɛmɔ ate mvandoho bɔ waha nabo? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Kuaniɛ ne guale edwirɛ ne. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ogua ne, bɔ oguale atee noa ne yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛte edwirɛ nala a, Satan baye edwirɛ bɔ bagua ne fi bɛ nu ne. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Afei koso, bɔ oguale nyɔboɛ so ne ɛhe: Bɛ de, sɛ bɛte edwirɛ nala a, bɛfa anigye bedɛ bɛto nu. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Nakoso bɛlle ndii, yeti bɛtena berɛ kaa, ná sɛ edwirɛ nati, beyia ɔhaw anaa bɛtane bɛ nye a, né wato bɛ sintidua. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ebie koso guale mmowie nu. Bɛ de bɛte edwirɛ ne, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />nakoso wiase nanu dadwene, ahonyadeɛ bɔ ɔlaka-laka bɛ, ɔne nningyein ahoroɛ nwo akɔnnɔ mia edwirɛ ne, na onzu mmaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Afei bɔ oguale aseɛ pa so ne yeɛ ole bɛ bɔ bɛte edwirɛ ne a, bedɛ ye kama na bɛsu mma ne. Ebie su 30, ebie su 60, na ebie koso su 100.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu sa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔsɔ kanea a, ɔfa wura kɛndɛn anaa mba bo ɔ? Nná kanea bakaa so yeɛ bɛfa besie ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ná nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ wafea bɔ ongofite ɔ; na hwee nne berɛ bɔ bafa basie fee bɔ ɔngɔwa kanea nu ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Ebiala bɔ ole asoɛ ne, ma otie.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Osa ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔtie ne yé. Ofikyɛ kongo bɔ ɛmɔfa bɛsusu nikye bɛma ebie ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkosusu bɛkɔma ɛmɔ ɔ. Na bɛkɔfa ebie bɛkɔboka ɛmɔ so. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Na ebiala bɔ ole bie ne, bɛkɔfa pee bɛkɔboka ye so, nakoso bɔ olle bie ne de, bɔ ole ye ne po, bɛkole bɛkofi ye sa nu.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Nyameɛ Ahennie ne te kyɛ ebie bɔ odua ye nningyein wɔ eburo. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ɔkɔda kɔngɔen dwɔso ngyerɛmɔ, na nningyein ne fifi, onyi yɛ tendee; nakoso atee bɔ ɔfa so yɛ sɔ ne de, ɔnze. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Aseɛ ne bɔbɔ yɛ ngakã-ngakã su mmaa, odi moa fa nyaa, afei ɔye bɛtire, na aleɛ ba bɛtire nanwo. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Na aleɛ ne tĩ a, ɔtwe ye dadeɛ kɔ ye nwo, ofikyɛ mmerɛ aso kyɛ bɛpɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yeti, osa hane kyɛ: “Nzu anwo yeɛ yɛfa Nyameɛ Ahennie ne yɛtoto ɔ? Na mvandoho beni yeɛ yɛfa yɛhyirehyire nu ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ɔte kyɛ sinapi mmaa; mmaa bɔ bɛdua ye wɔ aseɛ ye aso de, yeɛ ɔte kaa ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Nakoso sɛ bɛdua a, onyi yɛ piri tra atɔsodeɛ mukoraati, na ɔyeye asaa ngandinga maa ewienu nnomaa yɛ bɛ buye ye fɔnwoo nabo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yeti, mvandoho sɔa mɔ yeɛ Yesu fa hane edwirɛ ne hyirele bɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔte yebo ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Wanga hwee wangyire bɛ bɔ mvandoho bokka so ɔ. Nakoso, sɛ ɔka ɔne asuafoɛ ne ngome a, okyirekyire nikye biala nu kyire bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, ɔha hyirele asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yɛhɔ nzue ne si dɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Yeti, bɛguale mmenia nemɔ atee bɛyiele ne, bɛɛbokale Yesu so, ofikyɛ né ɔte ɛlɛen nanu dada, na ne ɛlɛen foforɛ koso boka ye so. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Wangyɛ biala, mvrama kandinga bie hyɛle yebo tuli, na né asorɔkye ne bu fa ɛlɛen naso, ɔhale sɔa, ahaa bɛmono. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Nakoso Yesu de, né wala sumu bie so wɔ ɛleɛn ne si dɔ. Yeti, bɛtingyele ye, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yeti yɛbaawu ne, ɔmva wɔ nwo?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yeti Yesu dwɔsole, na ɔteane mvrama ne né nzue ne kyɛ: “Yɛ konn! Yɛ dinn!” Na mvrama ne yakyile, na ɔyɛle dinn. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Na obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ né ɛmɔsuro ne? Nzu ɔ, ɛmɔlle gyidie?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Né esuronyi aha bɛ paa, yeti bɛbisale bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Sona beni ɛhe? Bɔ mvrama ne ɛpo po tie ye ne.”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Bɛhɔle ɛpo ne si dɔ ne, bɛɛfitele Gerasafoɛ mandanu dɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu fili ɛlɛen nanu dwuli nala pɛ, biaa bie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ye so fili asieleɛ naso dɔ yiale ye. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Asieleɛ naso yeɛ ne ɔte ɔ, na ɔbaadwu sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ebiala hora falle kyenyi kyekyele ye. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Ɔwɔ nu, né bɛtaa bɛfa kyenyi bɛkyekye ye gya ne ye sa, nakoso né ɔtete kyenyi nanu. Na ebiala nne berɛ bɔ né okonya anwoserɛ koli ye so ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Kɔngɔen ne eyia biala, né ɔteɛteanu wɔ asieleɛ ne né mmokaa naso, na ne ɔfa nyɔboɛ pepɛ ye nwo. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Mmerɛ bɔ ye nye bɔle Yesu so wɔ dede ne, otuli mirika hɔle ye nwo berɛ, na obuli ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Na ɔteane nu kyɛ: “Yesu, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Anwuro-anwuro né awa, nzu yeɛ ɔwɔ mene wɔ afia ɔ?”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nzu yeɛ mene wɔ le ye yɛ ɔ?” </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ofikyɛ ne Yesu aha ahyire ye kyɛ: “Wɔ, sunzummɔne, fi ye nu fite!” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ dumaa li sɛɛ?” Ɔhane kyɛ: “Me dumaa li Ɛlɔen, ofikyɛ yɛsone.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Na ɔsrɛle Yesu alaa kyɛ nnɛmaa ɔfoa bɛ fi sɔ aseɛ naso. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Né mbrako pee bie didi wɔ bokaa ne ngyɛnu dɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Yeti, sunzummɔne nemɔ srɛle Yesu kyɛ: “Ma yɛhɔ mbrako nemɔ nu; ma yeewura bɛ nu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Ɔmane bɛ atee, yeti sunzummɔne nemɔ fili biaa ne nu, na bɛɛwurale mbrako nemɔ nu. Ná mbrako kɔyɛ 2,000 ne tuli mirika fili bokaa naso dɔ beeguale ɛpo nanu, na bɛwuli.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Bɛ bɔ bɛnea mbrako ne nwatili, na bɛɛbɔle amaneɛ wɔ kuro nanu ne nnamue nemɔ nu, na mmenia nemɔ wale kyɛ bɛbaanea bɔ wasi ne. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Yeti, bɛwale Yesu berɛ, na mmerɛ bɔ bɛnwuni biaa bɔ né sunzummɔne pee wɔ ye so ne kyɛ ɔte berɛ, owura atadeɛ, na ye adwene nu ala berɛ ne, esuronyi hane bɛ paa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛnwuni bɔ wasi ne hane bɔ ɔtole biaa bɔ né sunzummɔne wɔ ye so ne, ɔne bɔ ɔtole mbrako ne hyirele mmenia nemɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Na mmenia nemɔ srɛle Yesu kyɛ, ofi bɛ mandanu berɛ hɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔfo ɛlɛen ne, biaa bɔ né sunzummɔne wɔ ye so ne srɛle ye kyɛ, ɔne ye kɔhɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Nakoso Yesu amma ye atee, mmom ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kɔ awuro, w'abusuafoɛ berɛ, na ka bɔ Awurade ayɛ ama wɔ namukoraati kyire bɛ, ɔne kyɛbɔ wanwu wɔ anwunvo ne.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Yeti ɔhɔle, na ɔhane bɔ Yesu ayɛ ama ye namukoraati wɔ Dekapoli, na ɔyɛle mmenia nemɔ nwanwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu sa pɛle ɛpo ne hɔle ye si dɔ ne, mmeni pee pɛle ye nwo yiale wɔ ɛpo ne noa berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Na biaa bie bɔ bɛfrɛ ye Yairo wale ye berɛ, né ɔte panyi wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. Mmerɛ bɔ onwuni Yesu ne, obuli ndwerɛ wɔ ye gya bo, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />na ɔsrɛle ye mmerɛ pee kyɛ: “Mma brasua kamba afokyɛ paa. Mesrɛ wɔ bra, na baafa wɔ sa gua ye so ma ye nwo tɔ ye, na onya ngoa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu ne ye hɔle, nakoso né mmeni pee li ye si, na ne bahyere ye so. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Né maame bie bɔ mogya atu ye afoɛ buru-ne-nyɔ wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Né wanwu amaneɛ paa wɔ dɔktafoɛ pee sa nu, na ne wasɛkye ye ahonyadeɛ mukoraati, nakoso anwonyerɛ ne angɔ, mmom ɛyɛlɛ ala yeɛ ne ɔyɛ piri ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele Yesu nwo dwirɛ ne, ɔfale mmenia nanu wɔ ye si, na ɔɔsɔle ye atadeɛ nanu, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />edwirɛ bɔ ne ɔka yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Sɛ mesɔ ye atadeɛ nanu mbaen po a, me nwo kɔtɔ me.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Na ɛberɛ nala, mogya ne pɛle, na onwuni ye wɔ ye weleɛ nu kyɛ, anwonyerɛ bɔ ɔteetee ye ne ahɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ɛberɛ ala, Yesu nwuni kyɛ tumi bie afi ye nu, na ɔkakyile ye nwo wɔ mmenia nanu bisale kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔsɔle m'atadeɛ nanu ne?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Nakoso, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Anwu kyɛ mmenia ahyere wɔ so, nakoso ebisa kyɛ, ‘Nwa yeɛ ɔfale ye sa hane me ne?’ ” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Nakoso, Yesu totole ye nye neane sɛ okonwu sona-horɛ a. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ne maame ne anwu bɔ wahɔ so wɔ ye nu nati, né osuro, na ne ye nwo popo. Na oobuli ndwerɛ wɔ Yesu nyunu hane edwirɛ nanu nahorɛ biala hyirele ye. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Baa brasua, wɔ gyidie amaa wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ. Fa asomdwie kɔ, na wɔ nwo tɔ wɔ koraa.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ogu so odwudwo ne, ebiemɔ fili Yairo awuro berɛ bɛɛha behyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛwa brasua ne awu! Nzuati yeɛ etɛ́ ha kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Nakoso, Yesu tele bɛ ngɔmmɔ ne, na ɔha hyirele biaa ne kyɛ: “Nnɛsuro, wɔ de, nya gyidie.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Wamma ebiala anni ye si, sana Petro, Yakobo, ne Yakobo aliema Yohane ngome. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bɛdwuli panyi ne awuro berɛ ne, onwuni kyɛ ɛberɛ ayɛ bagya-bagya, na né bɛsu bɛteɛtea nu. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ɔhɔle awuro berɛ, na obisale kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛwa ayɛ bagya-bagya, na mmenia su teɛtea nu sɔ ne? Akwalaa ne wuli oo, wala.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Bɛtele sɔ dwirɛ nala, né bɛla ayanga.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ne bɛsere ye.”</char></note> Na mmerɛ bɔ ɔmaa mmenia namukoraati fitele ne, ɔfale akwalaa ne baba ne ye maame, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛboka ye so ne, na bɛhɔle nekaa bɔ akwalaa ne la ne. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu sɔle abayaa ne sa nu, na ɔhane kyɛ: “<char style="tl">Talita kum</char>,” yebo kyire kyɛ: “Abayaa, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ dwɔso!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ɛberɛ nala, akwalaa ne dwɔsole, na ɔnatele. (Né wali afoɛ 12) Na edwirɛ ne yɛle bɛ nwanwa pa. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Na Yesu hyɛle bɛ kitii kyɛ, bɛnea yé, ná ebiala ande ye nwo dwirɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ bɛma ye aleɛ ma oli.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu fili berɛ hɔle ye kuro, na ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ boka ye so. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Odwuli Homeda ne, ɔhyɛle yebo yɛle ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu. Na bɛ bɔ betie ye nanu pee nwo dwirili bɛ, na bɛbisale kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ akoaa he suane sɔ nningyein ne? Nzuati yeɛ bama ye nyanza sɔ ne? Na ɔyɛle sɛɛ po yeɛ ɔkora yɛ sɔ anwanwadeɛ ne? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nná Mary awa kapentaniɛ ne ɛhe? Nná oliema yeɛ ole Yakobo, Yosef, Yuda, ne Simon? Na nná oliema mmrasua yeɛ yɛne bɛ wɔ wa ne?” Yeti, ɔyɛle sintidua mane bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yeɛ Yesu hane kyɛ: “Sɛ diifoɛ bie anuonyam kɔbɔ ye a, né ɔte ye kuro, ye abusuafoɛ, ne ye bɔbɔ ye awurofoɛ nu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yeti, wanyɛ anwanwadeɛ pee wɔ berɛ, bɔ ɔyɛle ala yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔfale ye sa guale mmenia kaa bie so sale b'anwonyerɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ɔyɛle ye nwanwa kyɛ né bɛlle gyidie ɔ. Yeti, ohyinini nnamue nemɔ nu hyirehyirele bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yesu frɛle buru-ne-nyɔ ne, na ɔhyɛle yebo somane bɛ nyɔ-nyɔ, na ɔmane bɛ sunzummɔne so tumi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Afei, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛfa hwee bɛtu atee ne, sana pɔmaa. Nnɛmaa bɛfa paanoo, aleɛ bɔtɔ, na nnɛmaa bɛfa sikaa bɛwura b'abɔsoɛ nu, <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />mmom bɛwura mmaboa, nakoso nnɛmaa bɛfa ndadeɛ nyɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Awuro biala bɔ ɛmɔ kowura nu ne, ɛmɔtena berɛ kodwu kyɛ ɛmɔ kofi berɛ bɛkɔhɔ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Nekaa biala bɔ banne ɛmɔ, anaa bandie ɛmɔ ne, sɛ ɛmɔfi berɛ bɛkɔ a, ɛmɔ poro-poro ɛmɔ gya bo mvuture bɛgua berɛ, ná wayɛ adanzeɛ wama bɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Yeti bɛsili nu bɛhɔle, na bɛha bɛhyirele mmenia kyɛ bɛsakra b'adwene. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bɛtuli sunzummɔne pee, na bɛfale ngoo bɛpopale mmeni pee bɛsale b'anwonyerɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ɔhene Herode tele ɛhe anwo dwirɛ, ofikyɛ ne Yesu dumaa atrɛ ahɔ nekaa biala, na ne mmenia keka kyɛ: “Yohane Suboniɛ adwɔso afi ewue nu! Yeti yeɛ ɔkora yɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ pee sɔ ne.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Nakoso ebiemɔ hane kyɛ: “Elia ane,” yeɛ ebiemɔ koso nwa: “Ɔte diifoɛ te kyɛ tete adiifoɛ nemɔ ala.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ Herode tele ɛhe ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Yohane bɔ mbɛle ye ti ne yeɛ watingye ne!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Né Herode agya oliema Filipo aye Herodia, ɛhene ati yeɛ ɔmaa bɛhyele Yohane bɛkyekyele ye bɛtole prizin ne. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ofikyɛ daa né Yohane ka kyire Herode kyɛ: “Mmeraa mma atee kyɛ egya eliema aye.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Yeti, né Yohane nwo dwirɛ wura Herodia nu, na né ɔpena ye ku ye, nakoso wangora. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Né Herode se kyɛ Yohane te teneneeniɛ, na ɔte krongron, ɛhene ati né suro ye, na ɔbɔle ye nwo waen. Sɛ ɔte Yohane dwirɛ ne a, né wayɛ basaa, nakoso ne ye nye gye ye nwo kyɛ okotie ye. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Nakoso, Herodia nyane ye nwo atee bie. Ɛlɛho bɔ ne Herode di ye awoda ne, ɔyɛle paati mane ye atitire, asahene, ne Galilea mbanyi sɔ nnɔsoa ne. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Na Herodia awa brasua gole maa Herode ne bɛ bɔ ɔne bɛ didi ne nye gyele ye abilie nanwo paa, yeti ɔhene ne hane kyɛ: “Nikye biala bɔ ekuro ne, ka, na ngɔyɛ ngɔma wɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Na ɔhane ndaen kyɛ: “Nikye biala bɔ ekobisa ne, sɛ ɔte m'ahennie ne bue po a, ngɔfa ngɔma wɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Yeti, ɔhɔle ye maame berɛ, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ nne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmisa”</char></note> ɔ?” Na ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yohane Suboniɛ ti.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ɛberɛ ala yeɛ otuli mirika hɔle ɔhene ne berɛ ɔ, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Mepena kyɛ ɛfa Yohane Suboniɛ ti to plɛte so ma me kesaalae.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Edwirɛ ne yɛle ɔhene ne yea paa, nakoso ɔnate ndaen bɔ waha, ɔne ɛwɔfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nati, bɔ abayaa ne hane ne, wammɔ wangua. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ɛberɛ ala, ɔhene ne somane adumfoɛ nanu kõ, na ɔhyɛle ye kyɛ ɔɔpɛ Yohane ti bra. Yeti, ɔhɔle prizin dɔ ɔɔpɛle Yohane ti, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />na ɔfa tole plɛte so brɛle abayaa ne, na ye koso, ɔfa ɔɔmane ye maame. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yohane asuafoɛ nemɔ tele bɔ wasi ne, bɛɛfale fuin ne besiele ye.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Asomafoɛ nemɔ sa wale Yesu berɛ, na bɛhane bɔ bahora bayɛ ne bɔ bahyirehyire namukoraati bɛhyirele ye. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔbra, ná ɛmɔɔwura nekaa bie bɛle ɛmɔ nwomeɛ kaa.” Ofikyɛ ne mmeni pee di berɛ akɔ-ne-aba, na ne bennya mmerɛ po né badidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Yeti, bɛfale ɛlɛen kyɛ bɛkwaawura nekaa bie dinn. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Nakoso, ebiemɔ nwuni kyɛ bɛkɔ, na mmeni pee koso tele, yeti bɛtuli mirika bɛfili nguro nanu bɛlili bɛ nyunu moa. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu fili ɛlɛen nanu dwuli bɔ onwuni mmenia bɔ bɛgua berɛ ne, bɛyɛle ye anwunvo, ofikyɛ né bayɛ kyɛ mmoan bɔ bɛlle ebie bɔ ɔnea bɛ ne. Yeti, ɔhyɛle yebo hyirehyire bɛ nningyein pee. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛwa ate ye nwo, na aleɛ koso asa. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Yeti, gua mmenia ne atee, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔhora bɛkɔhɔ nguro ne nnamue bɔ wapɛ yɛ nwo wayia ne bie nu, na baatɔ aleɛ bali.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma bɛ aleɛ ma bɛli.” Na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Yɛɛtɔ paanoo dɛnare 200 yɛbrɛ bɛ ma bɛli anaa?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Na obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Paanoo nyɛɛ yeɛ ɛmɔle ye wɔ berɛ ɔ? Ɛmɔɔnea.” Bɛɛneane ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Nnu, yeɛ egyein nyɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yeti, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, bɛma mmenia ne tena kue-kue wɔ nzenzaen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Paake.”</char></note> naso. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Yeti, bɛtenane ase kue-kue, né ebiemɔ te 100, yeɛ ebiemɔ te 50. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Afei Yesu fale paanoo nnu ne egyein nyɔ ne, na ɔneane anwuro hyirale so. Na ɔfa mane asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ bɛfa bɛma mmenia ne. Na ɔhyɛle egyein ne koso mane bɛ mukoraati. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Yeti, bɛ mukoraati, bɛlili maa bɛ ko yili, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />na bɛsesale ye boso ngɛndɛn 12 tɛkyɛ, né egyein ne bokka so. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Mmrienzua 5,000 yeɛ bɛlili paanoo ne ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ɛberɛ ala, Yesu maa asuafoɛ nemɔ fole ɛlɛen hɔle nzue ne si dɔ wɔ Betsaida ɛpo ne noa dɔ, na ye de, oguale mmenia nemɔ atee. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Oguale bɛ atee yiele ne, ɔhɔle bokaa naso dɔ kyɛ ɔkwaabɔ mbaeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Aleɛ sane ne, né ɛlɛen ne wɔ ɛpo ne afia, na Yesu ngome yeɛ ne ɔwɔ aseɛ naso ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Né onwu ye kyɛ mvrama ne bɔ yia bɛ, yeti né wayɛ se wama bɛ kyɛ bɛkɔha ɛlɛen ne. Ná odwuli alobahene ne, ɔfale ɛpo naso hɔle bɛ nwo dɔ, na ɔyɛle kyɛ osa bɛ nwo. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Nakoso, bɛnwuni kyɛ ɔnate ɛpo naso ne, bɛteɛteane nu, ofikyɛ né bɛse kyɛ banwu honhom bie. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛ mukoraati bɛnwuni ye ne, esuronyi hane bɛ. Nakoso, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔha ɛmɔ ahone bɛto ɛmɔ kunu! Me ane, nnɛmɔ suro.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Na ɔfo tenane ɛlɛen nanu ne, mvrama ne yakyile. Na ɔyɛle asuafoɛ ne nwanwa paa, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ofikyɛ ne bennya bɛtele paanoo nwo dwirɛ nabo, né b'ahone nya tele yebo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bɛpɛle nzue ne bɛhɔle ye si dɔ ne, bɛɛdwuli Genesaret, na bɛfale ɛlɛen ne bɛsiele berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bɛfi ɛlɛen nanu bɛdwuli ala pɛ, mmenia nwuni ye, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />na bɛfale mirika bɛhyinini mandanu berɛ mukoraati, bɛfale bɛ bɔ bafokyɛ bɛguale bɛen so bɛhɔle nekaa biala bɔ bɛtele kyɛ ɔwɔ ne. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Na nekaa biala bɔ ɔkɔhɔ ne, kyɛ ɔte akuraa nu, kuro nu, anaa nnamue nu ne, ɔkɔhɔ ne, né bafa bɛ bɔ bafokyɛ ne bagua dwaaso berɛ, na bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔma bɛfa bɛ sa bɛha ye atadeɛ ne noa mbaen. Na bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle sɔ namukoraati nwo tɔle bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Farisifoɛ ne atwerɛfoɛ bɔ bafi Yerusalem bawa ne wale Yesu berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Na bɛnwuni kyɛ ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fa asaa bɔ ye nwo nnde bɛdidi; kyire kyɛ bɛdidi ne, bannwunzi bɛ sa. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Né Farisifoɛ ne Yudafoɛ nemɔ tɛ́ tra bɛ nana mɔ amammerɛ nu, yeti sɛ bɛkɔdidi a, sana bɛnwunzi bɛ sa maa ɔbadwu bɛ batwɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Na sɛ bɛfi dwaaso bɛba awuro a, bɛnnidi, sana babia kora. Né basɔ amammerɛ pee nu twann, ebie yeɛ ole kwangoa, dansɛen,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔkɔhora koso kɔyɛ kwangoa mbiri.</char></note> ne kɔɔbere ayaa mɔ bɔ bɛbɔ bɛ asu.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Yeti, Farisifoɛ ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ w'asuafoɛ nemɔ nni nana mɔ amammerɛ so, na bɛfa asaa bɔ ye nwo nnde bɛdidi ne?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nyaatwomfoɛ, ngɔm bɔ Isaiah hyɛ fale ɛmɔ nwo ne, ɔfata ɛmɔ. Ɔhane kyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Maen he fa bɛ noa mbaen yeɛ bɛdi me ni ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">nakoso b'ahone de, ɔnne me nwo koraa.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Bɛ so me mbaen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">ofikyɛ sona ahyɛdeɛ yeɛ bɛ kyirekyire ɔ.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Ɛmɔ abu ɛmɔ nye bagua Nyameɛ ahyɛdeɛ so, yeɛ ɛmɔ atira ɛmɔ nana mɔ amammerɛ nu twann.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Serɛ-serɛ”</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ afa atee bie so<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyanza-nyanza”</char></note> bapia Nyameɛ ahyɛdeɛ ne bato nekaa bie, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔkoli ɛmɔ nana mɔ ahyɛdeɛ so ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ofikyɛ Mose hane kyɛ: ‘Fa nidie ma wɔ maame ne wɔ baba,’ na ‘Ebiala bɔ ɔkɔha edwirɛ tɛɛ kotia ye baba anaa ye maame ne, odikyɛ bɛku ye.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de ɛmɔka kyɛ, ‘Sɛ ebie ka kyire ye maame anaa ye baba kyɛ: “Nikye biala bɔ nne ye, bɔ ahaa ekonya so mvasoɛ ne te <char style="tl">korban</char> (kyire kyɛ, ɔte akyɛdeɛ bɔ mafa mama Nyameɛ)” ’ a, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />ɛmɔ mma ɔnyɛ hwee mma ye baba anaa ye maame. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Yeti, ɛmɔ afa ɛmɔ amammerɛ ne basɛkye Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne. Na nningyein pee bɔ ɔte sɔa yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu frɛle mmenia ne wale ye nwo berɛ bieku, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔtie me, ná ɛmɔte ye bo kyɛ, <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />nikye biala nne berɛ, bɔ ofi aluo kɔ sona nu bɔ ɔkora gua ye nwo fiɛ ɔ; mmom bɔ ofi sona ne nu fite ne, ɛhene yeɛ ogua ye nwo fiɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, bafa edwirɛ bie bawura ɛwa kyɛ: “</char><char style="it">Bɔ ole asoɛ bɔ ɔkɔfa kotie ne, ma otie</char>.” Nakoso sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ odi mu paa, ɔne bɔ wahyɛ paa nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne nne nu. </note>― <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu fili mmenia nanu wurale awuro bie nu ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ bisale ye mvandoho nanwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnde ye bo? Nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ ofi aluo kɔ sona nu, bɔ ɔkɔhora kogua ye nwo fiɛ ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />ofikyɛ, ɔngɔ ye ahone nu, mmom ɔkɔ ye kunu, ná wafi ye nu waagua ɛyaen nu.” Ɔhane ɛhe fa tele aleɛ biala nwo. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Na ɔtoale so kyɛ: “Mmom bɔ ofi sona nu ba ne, ɛhene yeɛ ogua ye nwo fiɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ofikyɛ sona nu, ye ahone nu yeɛ adwemmɔne, adwamammɔ, awie, awudie, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />agyaa sɛkyelɛ, adufudeɛ, amumuyɛɛ, nnaka-nnaka, ahohwibra, anyeborolɛ, mmusue dwirɛ, ɛdwɛɛ, ne ngwaseasɛm fi ba ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ɛhemɔ mukoraati fi sona nu, na ogua ye nwo fiɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ofili berɛ ne, ɔhɔle Tiro ne Sidon mandanu dɔ. Ɔhɔle awuro bie nu, na né ɔmbena kyɛ ebiala nwu kyɛ wawa berɛ, nakoso wangora fea. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Wangyɛ biala, maame bie bɔ sunzummɔne wɔ ɔwa abayaa so tele ye nga, na ɔwale berɛ ɔɔkotele ye gya bo. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Né ɔte Greekniɛ bɔ bɛwole ye wɔ Foinike bɔ ɔwɔ Siria<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ne ɔte Siria-Foinikeniɛ.”</char></note> ne. Maame ne srɛle Yesu alaa kyɛ, otu sunzummɔne ne fi ɔwa brasua ne nu. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Nakoso, Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ma ngwalaa ne ko yi kora, ofikyɛ ɔttemaye kyɛ ɛkɔfa ngwalaa paanoo kɔma ngyea.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Maame ne koso hane kyɛ: “Awurade, ɔte nahorɛ. Mmom bɔ ofi ngwalaa nemɔ tɛbulu naso gua ase ne, ɛhene yeɛ ngyea ne di ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Na Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Bɔ aha nati, kɔ; sunzummɔne ne afi ɛwa brasua ne nu.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Yeti ɔhɔle, na odwuli awuro ne, onwuni kyɛ, ɔwa ne la berɛ bɔ sunzummɔne ne afi ye nu ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ofili Tiro mandanu berɛ, na ɔfale Sidon hɔle Galilea po ne noa ɔɔfale Dekapoli mandanu dɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Na bɛfale biaa bie bɛbrɛle ye, né ye so ati, na né ɔngora dwudwo pa. Na bɛsrɛle Yesu kyɛ ɔfa ye sa gua ye so. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu fale ye fili mmenia nanu berɛ hɔle ahameɛ, na ɔfale ye sa wuro-wurale ye so nanu. Afei ɔtele ngɔserɛ, na ɔfale ye sa hane ye temverema. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Na ɔneane anwuro guale nwomeɛ, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “<char style="tl">Hefata!</char>” Ye bo kyire kyɛ, “Bukye.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Na ɛberɛ ala, ye so ne bukyele, na ye temverema ne sangyele, na ɔhyɛle yebo dwudwole kama. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛbɔso bɛkyire ebiala. Nakoso, ogu so ɔbɔ bɛ noa ne, bɛ koso né bɛbɔ ye dawure. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ɔyɛle mmenia nemɔ nwanwa paa, na bɛhane kyɛ: “Wayɛ nikye biala yé. Wamaa bɔ ye so atĩ ne po ate edwirɛ, na ɛmumu koso adwudwo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Sɔ ngyẽa nanu ne, mmeni lɔen bie sa wale Yesu berɛ, na né bɛlle hwee bɔ bɛkoli ɔ. Yesu frɛle ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Mmenia nemɔ yɛ me anwunvo, ɛlɛsa yeɛ bafa batena me nwo wa ɔ, ná belle hwee bɔ bɛkoli ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Sɛ me maa bɛfa ɛhɔen bɛkɔ awuro a, annea a né bapɛ bafi atee nu. Na ebiemɔ te dede paa.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ye asuafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ɛwa ate ye nwo, ye de nisua yeɛ yekonya paanoo bɔ ɔkɔso sɔ mmenia hemɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Paanoo nyɛɛ yeɛ ɛmɔle ye wɔ berɛ ɔ?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Nzoo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Na ɔmaa mmenia ne tena-tenane ase. Afei ɔfale paanoo nzoo ne, na ɔlale Nyameɛ ase. Yeɛ obubuli nu fa mane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ bɛ koso, bɛhyɛ bɛma mmenia nemɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Né bɛle egyein kaa wɔ berɛ, Yesu hyirale so, na ɔhane kyɛ bɛfa ɛhene koso bɛma bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Mmenia ne lili maa bɛ ko yili, na asuafoɛ nemɔ sesale ye boso ngɛndɛen nzoo bɔ wayiyi dɛm. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Mmrienzua kɔyɛ 4,000 yeɛ ne bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. Oguale bɛ atee nala, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fole ɛlɛen, na bɛhɔle Dalmanuta mandam nanu dɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Farisifoɛ nemɔ wale berɛ, na bɛne ye sule aporowaa paa. Né bɛpena kyɛ bɛsɔ ye bɛnea, yeti bɛhane kyɛ ɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ ofi anwuro ma bɛnea. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Ɛhe maa ye wora bɔle paa na ɔhane kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ ne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ he.”</char></note> pena nzɛngyerɛneɛ ɔ? Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛngonya nzɛngyerɛneɛ biala.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yeti, ɔyakyile bɛ berɛ, na ɔfole ɛlɛen ne sa hɔle nzue ne si dɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ná asuafoɛ nemɔ wora fili kyɛ bɛkɔfa paanoo, na né bɛlle hwee wɔ ɛlɛen nanu, paanoo komapɛ yeɛ né bɛle ye ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeti, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ Farisifoɛ ne Herode mmɔka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yiste—nikye bɔ ɔmaa esam tu.”</char></note> nwo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛhane kyɛ, “Sãa yamva paanoo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu nwuni ye sɔ ne, obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ paanoo bɔ ɛmɔ amva nati, ɛmɔ dwudwo ne? Yeti, ɛmɔ nwuni bɔ meka ne, na ɛmɔ telle yebo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />‘Ɛmɔle anyeɛ, nakoso ɛmɔnnwu nikye, ɛmɔle asoɛ, nakoso ɛmɔ nnde dwirɛ.’ Aso Ɛmɔngaye? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Mmerɛ bɔ mmubule paanoo nnu nu mmane mmenia 5,000 ne, ye boso bɔ ɛmɔ sesale ne, né ɔte kɛndɛn nyɛɛ?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Buru-ne-nyɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Na mmerɛ bɔ mmubule nzoo nanu mmane mmenia 4,000 ne, ye boso bɔ ɛmɔ sesale ne, né ɔte kɛndɛn nyɛɛ?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Nzoo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yeti, obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnya bɛnwuni bɔ ɛhene kyire ɔ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Bɛdwuli Betsaida ne, ebiemɔ fale anyesiniwaaniɛ bie brɛle ye, na bɛsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔfa ye sa ha ye. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yeti, ɔsɔle anyesiniwaaniɛ ne nu, na ɔfale ye fili kuro nanu. Afei ɔtele ngɔserɛ guale ye nye naso, na ɔfale ye sa sɔle ye nu. Yeɛ obisale ye kyɛ: “Ɛnwu nikye?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Biaa ne mane ye ti so, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Menwu kyɛ mmenia nate berɛ, nakoso bayɛ kyɛ mmakaa ne.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu sa fale ye sa guale biaa ne nye naso, na afei de onwuni nikye yé. Ye nye ne bukyele, na né ɔkora nwu nikye biala kama. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu fale ye hɔle awuro, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nnɛkɔ kuro nanu dɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fili berɛ hɔle Kaesarea Filipi nguraa nemɔ nu. Mmerɛ bɔ bɛnate atee so ne, obisale ye asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ: “Mmenia keka kyɛ, nde sona beni?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bɛyele ye noa kyɛ: “Ebiemɔ nwa Yohane Suboniɛ, ebiemɔ nwa Elia, yeɛ ebiemɔ koso nwa ɛte adiifoɛ nanu kõ.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnwa nde sona beni?” Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yeɛ Yesu hyɛle bɛ kitii kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛka ye nwo dwirɛ bɛkyire ebiala.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Afei ɔmaa bɛnwuni kyɛ, odikyɛ Sona Awa ne nwu amaneɛ paa, ná mbanyi nemɔ, sɔfo mbanyi, ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ ye ye ma maa beku ye, ná ɛlɛsa si ne, ɔkɔdwɔso. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ɔhane edwirɛ he wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu, nakoso Petro hwene ye hɔle ahameɛ, na ohwili ye nyunu. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yeɛ Yesu kakyile ye nwo neane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, na ohwili Petro nyunu kyɛ: “Fi berɛ kɔ dɔ, Satan! Ɛndwene Nyameɛ adwene, sona adwene yeɛ ɔwɔ wɔ ti anu ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Yesi ne, Yesu frɛle mmeni lɔen ne né ye asuafoɛ nemɔ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ odi me si a, ma ɔpa ye nwo si, ɔfa ye asɛnnua, na ɔhɔ so li me si. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔbɔ ye ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> nwo waen ne, okofi ye sa. Nakoso, ebiala bɔ mene nzɛmba nati, ye ngoa kofi ye sa ne, ye sa kɔha ye. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Na sɛ ebie nya wiase amukoraati, na ye ngoa fi ye sa a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ okonya ye ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Anaa nzu deinn yeɛ sona kɔhora kɔfa kɔsesa ye ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Na ebiala bɔ mene me dwirɛ nanwo kɔyɛ ye fɛle wɔ mmenia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ.”</char></note> bɔ bɛsɛkye agyaa ne abɔnefoɛ he anu ne, ye koso, ye nwo kɔyɛ Sona Awa ne fɛle mmerɛ bɔ wawa ye Baba anuonyam nu bɔ abɔfo krongron boka ye so ne.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Afei Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi wa nanu bie wɔ berɛ a, bɛngonwu sana banwu kyɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne di tumi kora.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ɛlɛsia si ne, Yesu fale Petro, Yakobo, ne Yohane, na ɔfale bɛ hɔle bokaa tendee bie so. Bɛ ngome yeɛ ne bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ, na ɔsakrale ye nwo wɔ bɛ nyunu. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Ye atadeɛ ne yɛle fufue hyɛnn, kyɛbɔ ne wayɛ hyɛnn ne, ebiala nne berɛ, bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔpo maa ɔkɔyɛ hyɛnn sɔ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Na Elia ne Mose wale Yesu nwo berɛ, na né bɛne ye bɔ ngɔmmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Yeɛ Petro ha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Rabi, ɔte pa kyɛ yɛwɔ wa ɔ. Ma yesi <char style="w">tɛnt</char> nza wɔ wa; wɔ deɛ kõ, Mose deɛ kõ, yeɛ Elia deɛ kõ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Nahorɛ nu, né Petro nnwu bɔ ɔha ɔ, ofikyɛ né esuronyi aha bɛ paa. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Afei, munungum bie katale bɛ so, na konviɛ bie fili munungum nanu wale kyɛ: “Ɛhe yeɛ ole mma bɔ medɔ ye ne. Ɛmɔtie ye.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Na ɛberɛ nala, bɛtole bɛ nye ne, bannwu ebiala, Yesu ngome yeɛ ne ogyi berɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Na bɛtoro bokaa ne bɛba ne, Yesu hyɛle bɛ kitii kyɛ, nnɛmaa bɛka ye nwo dwirɛ bɛkyire ebiala, kodwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne kotingye kofi ewue nu ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Yeti, bammɔ so bangyire ebiala, nakoso ne bɛdwene tingyelɛ bɔ okotingye kofi ewue nu nanwo. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ ka kyɛ, odikyɛ Elia di moa ba ne?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔte amba, Elia koli moa kɔwa kɔɔtoto nningyein mukoraati; nakoso nzuati yeɛ bahworɔ bafa Sona Awa nanwo kyɛ, odikyɛ onwu amaneɛ pee, na bɛbu ye animtia ne? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, Elia awa dada, na bɔ bɛkuro biala, bɛfa bɛyɛle ye, kyɛbɔ né bahworɔ bafa ye nwo nala.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛwale asuafoɛ bɔ baha nanwo berɛ ne, né mmeni pee apɛ bɛ nwo ayia, na né bɛne atwerɛfoɛ ne su aporowaa paa. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Nakoso, mmenia ne nwuni Yesu ne, bɛ kunu tele bɛ, na bɛtuli mirika bɛɛhyeale ye. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔsu ye nwo aporowaa ne?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nanu kõ hane kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, ɛmumu sunzum wɔ mma brienzua naso, yeti mvale ye mmerɛle wɔ; <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />nekaa biala bɔ ɔkɔha ye ne, ɔpɛ fi, yenoa pu ahure, ɔkwa ye gye, na ɔsenze. Nzrɛle wɔ asuafoɛ nemɔ kyɛ bɛtu bɛfi ye nu, nakoso bangora.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “O, ɛnɛ mmerɛ mmenia<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ.”</char></note> bɔ ɛmɔlle gyidie, mene ɛmɔ tena maa odwu kyẽa beni? Nnya ɛmɔ nwo aboterɛ maa oodwu kyẽa beni? Fa ye berɛ me.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Yeti, bɛfale akwalaa ne bɛwale, na mmerɛ bɔ sunzum ne nwuni Yesu ne, ɔmaa ɔsenzene, ɔpɛ fini, omunu-mununi ye nwo, na ye noa puli ahure. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu bisale ye baba ne kyɛ: “Mmerɛ beni yeɛ ɔhyɛle yebo yɛle yɛ ɔ?” Ɔhane kyɛ: “Ofi ye ngwalaa nu. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Na ɔtaa maa ɔpɛ fi see ne nzue nu, kyɛbɔ okohu ye ɔ. Sɛ ɛkɔhora kɔyɛ nikye bie kɔfa ye nwo a, nwu ye anwunvo, na boka yɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛnwa, ‘sɛ ɛkɔhora’ a, ebiala bɔ ole gyidie ne, nikye biala kɔyɛ yé kɔma ye.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ɛberɛ ala, akwalaa ne baba teane nu kyɛ: “Nne gyidie! Nekaa bɔ mehia gyidie ne, boka me!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Na Yesu nwuni kyɛ mmeni pee ba berɛ, yeti ɔteane sunzummɔne ne kyɛ: “Ɛmumu ne asotiniwaa sunzum, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, ‘Fi ye nu fite, na nnɛbawura ye nu kõ.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Na sunzum ne teane nu, na ɔmaa akwalaa ne senzene kyeinn, yeɛ ofili ye nu fitele ɔ. Ná akwalaa ne yɛle kyɛ ebie bɔ wawu ne, na mmenia ne hane kyɛ: “Wawu!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Nakoso Yesu sɔle ye sa nu mane ye so, na odwɔsole. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu hɔle awuro bie nu ne, ye asuafoɛ nemɔ bisale ye kokoanu kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ yangora sɔ sunzum ne tu ne?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛhe de, nikye fee ngora ye tu, sana mbaeɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Na bɛfili berɛ ne, bɛɛfale Galilea, nakoso, né onguro kyɛ ebiala te ye nwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Ofikyɛ ne okyirekyire ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Bɛkɔfa Sona Awa ne bɛkowura mmenia sa maa bɛkɔhu ye. Nakoso beku ye beyie a, ɛlɛsa si ne, ɔkɔdwɔso.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Bande sɔ dwirɛ nabo, nakoso né bɛsuro kyɛ bɛkobisa ye.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Bɛdwuli Kapernaum. Na mmerɛ bɔ ɔwɔ awuro berɛ ne, Yesu bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ne ɛmɔsu ye nwo aporowaa wɔ atee naso ne?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Nakoso bɛyɛle dinn, ofikyɛ bɛnate atee naso ne, né bɛsu bɔ ɔte piri wɔ bɛ nu nanwo aporowaa. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yeti ɔtenane ase, na ɔfrɛle buru-ne-nyɔ ne wale ye nwo berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɛ ebie pena kyɛ odi anyunu a, odikyɛ ɔpɛ yebo koraa, na ɔsõ ɛmɔ mu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Na ɔfale akwalaa kamba bie gyinane bɛ afia, yeɛ ɔfale ye sa tole ye kɔme anu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Ebiala bɔ odɛ́ ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ me dumaa nu ne, wale me koso; na ebiala bɔ okole me ne, nná me ngome yeɛ wale me ɔ, mmom wale bɔ ɔsomane me ne.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohane ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yɛnwuni kyɛ ebie fa wɔ dumaa tu sunzummɔne, na né yɛpena kyɛ yesi ye atee, ofikyɛ olli yɛ si.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔbokka yɛ so.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Nakoso, Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔsi ye atee, ofikyɛ ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔfa me dumaa kɔyɛ anwanwadeɛ, na ɛberɛ ala ɔkɔpɛ ye nwo kɔha edwirɛ tɛɛ kɔfa me nwo ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔndwɔso ndia yɛ ne, ɔboka yɛ so. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Kristo dumaa bɔ ɔla ɛmɔ so nati, sɛ ebie ma ɛmɔ nzue kwangoa kõ ma ɛmɔ no a, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ye akatua nngɔbɔ ye. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Nakoso, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔto mmaa-mmaa he anu kõ sintidua ne, sɛ bɛfale nyɔboɛ kandinga bɔ bɛfa bɛtĩ hwiit bɛtole ye kɔme bɛgyili ye bɛtole ɛpo nu po a, ahaa ɔte pa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />“Sɛ wɔ sa kõ to wɔ sintidua a, pɛ na gyi to. Ofikyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔfa asaa kõ kɔhɔ ngoa nu, tra kyɛ ɛkɔfa wɔ nipadua namukoraati kɔhɔ <char style="tl">Gehenna</char> see bɔ onnua nanu ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura wa kyɛ: “</char><char style="it">Ɛberɛ yeɛ nnɔboakoma nnwu, na see nnua ne</char>.” Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ odi mu paa, ɔne bɔ wahyɛ paa nanu a, ɔnne nu. Sɔ ala yeɛ ɔwɔ <char style="bd">9:46</char> ne. </note>― <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Na sɛ wɔ gya kõ to wɔ sintidua a, pɛ na gyi to. Ofikyɛ, ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔyɛ apakye kɔhɔ ngoa nu, tra kyɛ ɛkɔfa wɔ gya nyɔ namukoraati kɔhɔ <char style="tl">Gehenna</char>. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />― <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Na sɛ wɔ nye kõ to wɔ sintidua a, tu na gyi to. Ɔte pa kyɛ ɛkɔfa anyeɛ komapɛ kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nu, tra kyɛ ɛkɔfa wɔ nye nyɔ namukoraati kɔhɔ <char style="tl">Gehenna</char>. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Ɛberɛ yeɛ nnɔboakoma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nnɔboakoma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yeɛ ole ngaka mmaa-mmaa bɔ aleɛ anaa nikye bie sɛkye a, ɛyɛ a ne bɛ wuro-wura nu ne.</char></note> nwu, na see nnua ne. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Odikyɛ bɛfa see bɛwura ebiala ngyee. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Ngyee te pa, nakoso sɛ ye fɛɛ ne fi nu a, nzu yeɛ ɛmɔkɔfa bɛkowura ye ngyee bieku ɔ? Ɛmɔnya ngyee wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na ɛmɔ ne ebiala tena asomdwie nu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ofili berɛ wale Yudea ɛwɛen so, wɔ Yordan nzue ne si, na mmeni pee sa pɛle ye nwo yiale. Ná kyɛbɔ daa ɔyɛ ne, ohyirehyirele bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ná Farisifoɛ biemɔ wale ye berɛ kyɛ bɛbaasɔ ye bɛnea, yeti bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Mmeraa ma ate kyɛ brienzua yira ɔye anaa?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ahyɛdeɛ beni yeɛ Mose fa mane ɛmɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Mose mane atee kyɛ ɛkɔhora kɔhworɔ agyaa yiralɛ krataa kɔma brasua ne, na ayira ye.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ ahone bɔ ɔyɛ se nati yeɛ ɔmane ɛmɔ sɔ mmeraa ne. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Nakoso ahyɛaseɛ bɔ Nyameɛ bɔle nningyein nala, ‘Ɔyɛle bɛ brienzua ne brasua.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Ɛhe ati yeɛ brienzua kɔyakyi ye baba ne ye maame berɛ, na ɔne ɔye aha abɔnu <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />maa bɛ munyɔ ne ayɛ anwoɔnaen kõ,’ yeti bɛtte nyɔ kõ, mmom anwoɔnaen kõ. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Na bɔ Nyameɛ aha abɔnu ne, nnɛmaa sona biala tete nu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Mmerɛ bɔ besa bɛhɔle awuro ne, asuafoɛ nemɔ bisale ye ɛhe anwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ okoyira ɔye kogya foforɛ ne, wasɛkye agyaa, na wayɛ bɔne watia ɔye ne. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Na sɛ brasua yira ohu na osa gya foforɛ a, wasɛkye agyaa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Na né ebiemɔ fa ngwalaa berɛ ye maa ɔfa ye sa gua bɛ so, nakoso asuafoɛ nemɔ teɛteane bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu nwuni ɛhe ne, ɔfɛle bɛ so yaa, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma ngwalaa nemɔ bra me berɛ; nnɛmɔsi bɛ atee, ofikyɛ bɛ yeɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne te bɛ deɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ onne Nyameɛ Ahennie ne te kyɛ akwalaa ne, ɔngɔhɔ nu lle.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Afei ɔyɛle ngwalaa nemɔ atuu, na ɔfale ye sa guale bɛ so, hyirale bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔnate atee so ne, biaa bie le mirika oobuli ndwerɛ wɔ ye nyunu, na obisale ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ pa, nzu yeɛ meyɛ a, ngonya daa ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛka kyɛ nde sona pa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Pa.”</char></note> ɔ? Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte pa ɔ, sana Nyameɛ ngome. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ɛse mmeraa ne: ‘Nnɛdi awue, nnɛsɛkye agyaa, nnɛwia, nnɛdi adanzewia, nnɛsisi ebiala,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛyɛ aminɛ.” </char></note> bu wɔ baba ne wɔ maame.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Biaa ne ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, mvi me ngwalaa nu, yeɛ mali ɛhe amukoraati so ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Afei Yesu neane ye haa, na onyane ɔdɔ mane ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Waha wɔ nikye kõ: Kɔ, na kɔtɔne bɔ ɛle ye biala fa ma ahiafoɛ, na ekonya agyapadeɛ wɔ anwuro; afei bra bali me si.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Nakoso, edwirɛ ne hale biaa ne paa, ná ɔkɔ ne, né ye wora abɔ, ofikyɛ né ole agyapadeɛ paa.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Afei, Yesu tole ye nye neane mmenia bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, na ɔha hyirele ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Nea kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ se kɔma asikafoɛ kyɛ bɛkɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nu ɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Nakoso ye dwirɛ ne yɛle asuafoɛ ne nwanwa. Yeɛ Yesu sa hane kyɛ: “Me mmaa mɔ, ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ se kyɛ ebiemɔ kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ɔkɔyɛ mmerɛ kyɛ afupɔngɔ kowura paneɛ bɔen nu, tra kyɛ sikaniɛ kɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nu ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Ɛhe po de bɔle bɛ pusa, na bɛbisale kyɛ: “Ye de, nwa yeɛ okonya ngoa ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu neane bɛ haa, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɔhale sona ngome a, ahaa ɔngɔyɛ yé, nakoso nná Nyameɛ ɔ. Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ afa nu de, nikye biala kora kɔyɛ yé.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petro ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Yayakyi nikye biala berɛ yaali wɔ si.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ mene nzɛmba nati, wayakyi awuro, aliemaa mmrienzua, aliemaa mmrasua, maame mɔ, baba mɔ, mmaa, ne aseɛ, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />bɔ bɛngɔbɔ ye nwo 100 bɛngɔma ye ɔ. Okonya aliemaa mmrienzua, aliemaa mmrasua, maame mɔ, baba mɔ, mmaa, ne aseɛ wɔ wiase he anu, na bɛkɔtane ye nye koso. Na okonya daa ngoa wɔ wiase foforɛ bɔ ɔba nanu. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛli moa nanu pee kɔha siɛ, ná bɛ bɔ baha siɛ ne koli moa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛnate atee so bɛfo bɛkɔ Yerusalem ne, Yesu tele ye nwo lili moa, na ɔyɛle asuafoɛ nemɔ nwanwa. Na né bɛ bɔ bɛli ye si ne suro. Osa fale buru-ne-nyɔ ne hɔle ahameɛ, na ɔhyɛle yebo hane nningyein bɔ ɔbaato ye ne hyirele bɛ kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />“Ɛmɔnea, yɛfo yɛkɔ Yerusalem, na bɛkɔfa Sona Awa ne bɛkowura sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ ne sa. Bɛkobu ye kumfɔ, na bafa ye bawura Maen-maen nanufoɛ ne sa, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />na sɔ mmenia nemɔ kɔgoro ye nwo, bɛkɔtete ngɔserɛ bɛkogua ye nyunu, bɛkogwa ye, na bahu ye. Nakoso ɛlɛsa si ne, okotingye.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Na Sebedeo mmaa Yakobo ne Yohane wale Yesu berɛ, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, bɔ yɛkɔfa yɛkɔto wɔ nyunu biala, yɛpena kyɛ ɛyɛ ma yɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ meyɛ mema ɛmɔ ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yɛpena kyɛ ɛmaa yɛ nu kõ tena wɔ bɛen, na kõ tena wɔ famaa wɔ w'anuonyam nu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Nakoso, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnze nikye bɔ ɛmɔ bisa ne. Kwangoa bɔ mebaano ne, ɛmɔ kɔhora ye no? Na asu bɔ bɛbaabɔ me ne, ɛmɔ kɔhora bie bɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bɛhane kyɛ: “Yoo, yɛkɔhora.” Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Kwangoa ne de, ɛmɔ kɔno, na asu ne koso, ɛmɔ kɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Nakoso, me bɛen so ne me famaa so de, ɔtte me deɛ, ná mafa mama ɛmɔ; ɔte bɛ bɔ me Baba asiesie ama bɛ ne deɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Buru bɔ baha ne tele ɛhe ne, bɛfɛle Yakobo ne Yohane so yaa paa. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yeti Yesu frɛle bɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔse kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛdi maen-maen nanufoɛ naso ne de, bɛdi mmenia naso bakoma, na atitire ne fa bɛ tumi hyɛ bɛ so. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Nakoso, ɛmɔ de, nnɛmɔ maa ɔba ye sɔ; mmom ebiala bɔ ɔpena kyɛ ɔyɛ titire ne, odikyɛ ɔsõ bɛ bɔ baha ne, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />na bɔ ɔpena kyɛ odi anyunu ne, odikyɛ ɔyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati akoaa. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ofikyɛ, Sona Awa ne po amma kyɛ bɛsõ ye, mmom ɔwale kyɛ ɔbaasõ na ɔfa ye ngoa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kra.”</char></note> yɛ agyedeɛ, fa dɛ́ mmeni pee.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Afei, ɔwale Yeriko. Na mmerɛ bɔ ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ne mmeni lɔen ne fi berɛ kɔ ne, né Timeo awa Bartimeo, anyesiniwaaniɛ bɔ ɔsrɛ-srɛ nikye ne te atee né noa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele kyɛ Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu yeɛ ɔkɔ ne, ɔhyɛle yebo teɛteane nu kyɛ: “Yesu, David awa, nwu me anwunvo!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Mmeni pee teɛteane ye, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ, omua ye noa, nakoso ɔteɛteanu nu serɛ kyɛ: “Yesu, David awa, nwu me anwunvo!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yeti Yesu gyinane, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔfrɛ ye bɛma me.” Yeti, bɛfrɛle anyesiniwaaniɛ ne, na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Ka w'ahone to wɔ kunu, dwɔso, yenwa ɛbra.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Ogyile ye atadeɛ ne guale nekaa bie, yeɛ ɔdwɔso hɔle Yesu nwo berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu bisale ye kyɛ: “Nzu yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ meyɛ mema wɔ ɔ?” Anyesiniwaaniɛ ne hane kyɛ: “<char style="tl">Rabboni</char>, ma nwu nikye.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kɔ, wɔ gyidie amaa wɔ nwo atɔ wɔ.” Na ɛberɛ nala ye nye ne tele, na olili ye si wɔ atee naso.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Bɛ́pingye Yerusalem, na bɛdwuli Bɛtfage ne Betania bɔ ɔwɔ Olive Bokaa naso ne, ɔsomane ye asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ nnamue bɔ ɛmɔ nye ta ye dɔ nanu, ɛmɔ dwu berɛ a, ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ bamenda afunum ba bie bɔ ebiala ttenane ye so le. Ɛmɔ sangye ye, na ɛmɔfa ye bɛbra. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Na sɛ ebie bisa ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ne?’ a, ɛmɔha kyɛ, ‘Awurade hia ye, na oyie ala a, ɔkɔfa ye kɔwa.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Yeti bɛhɔle, na bɛnwuni afunum ne wɔ dwaaso berɛ, né bamenda ye wɔ anoa bie nyunu, na bɛsangyele ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne bie bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ sangye afunum ne?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Asuafoɛ nemɔ hane bɔ Yesu hane kyɛ bɛha ne, na bɛmaa bɛfale ye bɛhɔle. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bɛfale afunum ne bɛbrɛle Yesu, na bɛfale bɛ ndadeɛ bɛguale ye so maa ɔtenane ye so. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Afei mmeni pee fale bɛ ndadeɛ sɛle atee nanu, na ebiemɔ bubule nyaa fili ndire nanu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ná bɛ bɔ bɛli ye nyunu ne ye si ne hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“<char style="tl">Hozanna</char>!<note caller="●" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hozanna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">te Hebri dwirɛ bɔ yebo kyire kyɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wɔ, de ye.” Greek nu ne, sɔa yeɛ bɛtworɔ ye ɔ: “ὡσαννά (hōsanná).”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Nhyira yeɛ ole bɔ ɔba Awurade dumaa nu ne!<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Nhyira yeɛ ole yɛ Baba David ahennie bɔ ɔba ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Wɔ bɔ ɛwɔ anwuro-anwuro dɔ ne, <char style="tl">Hozanna!</char>”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Mmerɛ bɔ owurale Yerusalem kuro nanu ne, ɔhɔle asɔre awuro berɛ. Ɔtotole ye nye neane ɛberɛ mukoraati, nakoso ne aleɛ pena sa, yeti ɔne buru-ne-nyɔ ne hɔle Betania.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Na aleɛ hene bɔ bɛ́fi Betania ne, né ɛhɔen ku ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Na ye nye bɔle borɔdoma bie so wɔ dede, ne nyaa wɔ so, yeti ɔhɔle kyɛ ɔkwanea sɛ aleɛ wɔ so a. Nakoso odwuli berɛ ne, ne hwee nne so, nyaa ngome yeɛ ne ɔwɔ so ɔ. Ofikyɛ né ɔtte mmerɛ bɔ borɔdoma su ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yeti, ɔha hyirele bakaa ne kyɛ: “Ebiala nngoli wɔ so mmaa kõ.” Na ye asuafoɛ nemɔ tele sɔ dwirɛ ne. <verse eid="MRK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛdwuli Yerusalem ne, Yesu hɔle asɔre awuro berɛ, na ɔfoane bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne nningyein, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛtɔ namukoraati fili berɛ, na ɔhane bɛ bɔ bɛsesã sikaa nemɔ tɛbulu, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛtɔne mmubure nemɔ bia namukoraati guale ase. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Na wamma ebiala amva nikye fee ambɛ nu wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Na ohyirehyirele bɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Aso bɛhworɔlle kyɛ, ‘Bɛkɔfrɛ m'awuro ne maen-maen mukoraati mbaebɔ awuro’? Nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ ayɛ ye awiefoɛ adwosuo.” <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ tele ɛhe ne, né bɛsuro ye, ofikyɛ ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne maa mmenia ne nwo dwirili bɛ. Yeti né bɛpena atee bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛ kohu ye ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, Yesu ne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ fili kuro nanu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Na ngyerɛmɔ bɔ bɛse ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ borɔdoma bakaa ne awu fi anwuro waadwu yebo.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Waaha ye ndii.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petro kayele, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Rabi, nea borɔdoma bɔ edomene ye ne, wawu oo.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnya gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔha kohyire bokaa he kyɛ, ‘Tu kɔtɔ ɛpo nu,’ na onzu ye nwo aporowaa wɔ y'ahone nu, na mmom ole gyidie kyɛ bɔ waha ne kɔwa nu ne, ɔkɔwa nu kɔma ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Yeti, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔkɔbɔ ye nwo mbaeɛ ne, ɛmɔnya gyidie kyɛ ɛmɔ sa aha ye, na ɛmɔ konya ye. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Na sɛ ɛmɔgyina berɛ kyɛ ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ a, bɔ ebie afa ayɛ ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔfa bɛhyɛ ye, ná ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne koso kɔfa ɛmɔ bɔne kɔhyɛ ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bdit">“Nakoso sɛ ɛmɔ amva bangyɛ a, ɛmɔ Baba bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne koso ngɔfa ngɔhyɛ ɛmɔ lle.”</char> Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ odi mu paa, ɔne bɔ wahyɛ paa nemɔ nu a, ɔnne nu.</note>—<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛdwuli Yerusalem ne, né ɔne ye asuafoɛ nemɔ nate asɔre awuro berɛ. Ná sɔfo mbanyi, atwerɛfoɛ, ne kuro nanu mbanyi ne wale ye berɛ, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: “Tumi beni yeɛ ɛfa yɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ne? Na nwa yeɛ ɔmane wɔ sɔ tumi ne?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me bisa ɛmɔ dwirɛ kõ, sɛ ɛmɔye me noa a, ngɔha tumi bɔ mefa meyɛ sɔ nningyein ne ngohyire ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yohane asubɔ ne, né ofi anwuro anaa né ofi sona? Ɛmɔye me noa.” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Yeti bɛdwenene ye nwo kyɛ: “Sɛ yɛka kyɛ ‘Ofi anwuro’ a, okobisa yɛ kyɛ, ‘Ye de nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ anne ye banni ne?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Na yɛkɔyɛ sɛɛ na yaha kyɛ, ‘Ofi sona’?” Né bɛsuro mmenia ne, ofikyɛ né bɛ mukoraati bɛnwu ye kyɛ Yohane te diifoɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Yeti, bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Yɛnze.” Yeɛ Yesu koso ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nzaade me koso, tumi bɔ mefa meyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ne, mengɔha mengohyire ɛmɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ɔhyɛle yebo fale mvandoho hyirehyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Biaa bie yɛle bobe boo, olɛle ye nwo, otule nekaa bɔ bɛtwi nzãa wɔ nu, na osili awaen tendee wɔ nu. Afei ɔfa yakyile ahwɛsofoɛ, na otuli atee. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele bobe ne, ɔsomane ye akoaa kyɛ ɔhɔ ahwɛsofoɛ ne berɛ, na oole ye kyɛfa deɛ berɛ ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Nakoso, bɛhyele akoaa ne. Bɛbole ye, yeɛ bɛmaa ɔfale ye sa nzaa-nzaa hɔle ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ɔsomane akoaa foforɛ, na bɛfale nikye bɛbɔle ye ti anu, na bɛguale ye nyunu ase. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Osa somane akoaa foforɛ, na ye de, bɛhuni ye. Ɔsomane mmeni pee, na bɛbole ebiemɔ, yeɛ bɛhuni bɛ ngaa ne. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Né waha sona kõ, ye dɔba ne. Ɔsomane ye dɔ, na ɔhane kyɛ: ‘Mma ne de, bɛkɔfɛle ye.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Nakoso, ahwɛsofoɛ nemɔ ha hyirele bɛ nwo kyɛ: ‘Koliagyaa ne ɛhe. Ɛmɔbra ma yɛhu ye, na afei agyapadeɛ ne ayɛ yɛ deɛ.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Yeti, bɛhyele ye bɛhuni ye, na bɛgyili ye bɛtole ɛboo ne si. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Nzu yeɛ ɛboo ne wura ne kɔfa kɔyɛ bɛ ɔ? Okohu ahwɛsofoɛ nemɔ, ná wafa bobe boo ne wama mmeni foforɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Aso ɛmɔ kenngale sɔ tworɔnzɛm he lle:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Nyɔboɛ bɔ brekyafoɛ ne gyi tole ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">ɛhene yeɛ waayɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa ne.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ɛhe fi Awurade berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">na ɔyɛ yɛ nwanwa’? ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Ɛhe ati, né bɛpena kyɛ bɛkye ye, ofikyɛ né bɛse ye paa kyɛ bɛ ti yeɛ ɔyɛle sɔ mvandoho ne. Nakoso né bɛsuro mmenia ne, yeti bɛyakyile ye berɛ bɛhɔle.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ye si ne, bɛsomane Farisifoɛ nanu biemɔ ne bɛ bɔ bɛta Herode si ne bie, kyɛ bɛyɛ ma ɔha edwirɛ bie, na wamaa banya ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bɛdwuli berɛ ne, bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, yɛse kyɛ ɛka nahorɛ, na ɛmbena anuonyam wɔ ebiala nyunu, ofikyɛ ɛnnea sona nyunu, na bɔ ekyirekyire fa Nyameɛ nwo ne koso te nahorɛ. Mmeraa ma atee kyɛ yɛtua toɔ yɛma Kaesare, anaa ɔmma ate? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Yɛ tua, anaa nnɛmaa yɛtua?” Nakoso, Yesu nwuni bɛ nyaatwom ne, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ baasɔ me bɛnea ne? Ɛmɔma me dɛnare ne kõ ma nnea.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Yeti bɛbrɛle ye kõ, yeɛ obisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nwa foto ne ye sa noa yeɛ ɔwɔ so ne?” Bɛhane kyɛ: “Kaesare.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔtua Kaesare deɛ bɛma Kaesare, na ɛmɔtua Nyameɛ deɛ bɛma Nyameɛ.” Na ye nwo yɛle bɛ nwanwa paa.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Afei Sadukifoɛ bɔ bɛnwa bɛngɔtingye awufo ne wale ye berɛ, na bɛbisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, Mose hworɔle kyɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ tee: “Mose hworɔ mane yɛ.”</char></note> sɛ brienzua bie anwo mmaa na owu a, odikyɛ oliema brienzua gya ɔye ne, na ɔwo mmaa ma oliema ne. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Né aliemaa mmrienzua nzoo bie wɔ berɛ. Bɔ oli moa ne gyale braa, nakoso ɔne ye annwo, yeɛ owuli ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne gyale kunaniɛ ne, na ye koso ɔne ye annwo, bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne koso yɛle sɔ ala. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Mmrienzua nzoo namukoraati ne ye annwo. Afei brasua ne wuli. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Sɛ bɛtingye bɛ a, nwa yeɛ okogya brasua ne ɔ? Ofikyɛ mmrienzua nzoo namukoraati gyale ye.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛhe ati yeɛ ɛmɔdi mvomsoɛ ne, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnde tworɔnzɛm nabo, ná ɛmɔnze Nyameɛ tumi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Sɛ bɛtingye awufo a, mmrienzua ngogya, na bɛngɔfa mmrasua koso bɛngɔma agyaa. Bɛkɔyɛ kyɛ abɔfo bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro ne. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Na ɔfa awufo bɔ bɛkotingye bɛ nanwo ne, ɛmɔ kenngale Mose nwomaa ne, edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa ndire nanwo ne? Ɛberɛ yeɛ Nyameɛ ha hyirele ye kyɛ: ‘Nde Abraham Nyameɛ, Isaac Nyameɛ, ne Yakob Nyameɛ’ ne. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ɔtte awufo Nyameɛ, mmom ateasefoɛ Nyameɛ. Ɛmɔdi mvomsoɛ paa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Atwerɛfoɛ nanu kõ tole b'aporowaa naso. Na mmerɛ bɔ onwuni kyɛ Yesu ama bɛ mmuayɛ bɔ ɔtɔ asoɛ nu ne, obisale ye kyɛ: “Mmeraa nanu beni yeɛ oli moa ɔ?”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ye nwo hia paa”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Bɔ oli moa yeɛ ole ɛhe, ‘O Israel tie, Awurade yɛ Nyameɛ te Awurade kõ, <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />na odikyɛ ɛfa w'ahone mukoraati, wɔ kra mukoraati, w'adwene mukoraati, ne w'anwoserɛ mukoraati dɔ Awurade wɔ Nyameɛ.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ yeɛ ole ɛhe: ‘Dɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo.’ Mmeraa biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔtra ɛhemɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ɔha hyirele Yesu kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, bɔ aha ne te nahorɛ turoloo, ‘Ɔte komapɛ,’ na ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte kyɛ ye, <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />na sɛ ɛfa w'ahone mukoraati, w'adwene mukoraati, ne w'anwoserɛ mukoraati dɔ ye, na ɛdɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo a, ɔtra ngaka afɔleɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛyeralɛ afɔleɛ.”</char></note> ne afɔleɛ biala.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu nwuni kyɛ biaa ne mmuayɛ nanu la berɛ, yeti ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Ɛne Nyameɛ Ahennie n'afia nnwale.” Na ebiala annya akukuduro ammisa ye dwirɛ biala kõ.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Na mmerɛ bɔ Yesu yɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, obisale kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ ka kyɛ Kristo ne te David awa ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ofikyɛ honhom krongron ne maa David hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Awurade ha hyirele me wura kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“Tena me sa famaa so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">kodwu kyɛ ngɔfa w'atamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">ngogua wɔ gya bo.” ’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Yeti, David bɔbɔ frɛle ye me wura; ye de, ɔwale ye sɛ yeɛ ɔte ɔwa ɔ?” Na né mmeni lɔen ne fa anigye tie ye.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Ogu so okyirekyire ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ nwo, bɛ de, bɛkuro ndadeɛ ndendee wuralɛ ne dwaaso ngyeaa. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Na sɛ bɛkɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu a, bɛkuro anyunu bia, ná bɛpena mbanyi bia wɔ paati bo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Nakoso bɛsisi kunaniɛ bedɛ ye nwo nningyein, na nyaatwom ti, bɛbɔ mbaeɛ tendebaa. Asotwe bɔ ɔkɔwa bɛ so ne, ɔkɔtra ebiala deɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu tenane ase, na né ye nye tua sikaa alaka ne, né ɔnea bɛ bɔ bɛfa sikaa bɛgua alaka nanu ne. Ná asikafoɛ pee fale sikaa pee guale nu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Na brasua kunaniɛ hianiɛ bie wale, na ɔfale ngaprɛ nyɔ bɔ ɔngora hwee tɔ guale nu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yeɛ Yesu frɛle ye asuafoɛ nemɔ wale ye nwo berɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ.”</char></note> bɛ bɔ bafa sikaa bagua alaka nanu ne, kunaniɛ hianiɛ he deɛ ne yeɛ ɔsone ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Ofikyɛ bɛ mukoraati, bɔ banya ye maa wabo bɛ so ne bie yeɛ bɛfa bɛguale nu ɔ, nakoso maame ne de, ofi ye hiaa nu wafa bɔ ole ye biala, bɔ ɔkɔfa kɔnea ye nwo namu, yeɛ wafa wagua nu ne.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ofí asɔre awuro berɛ kɔ ne, asuafoɛ nanu kõ wale ye berɛ, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ, nea nyɔboɛ ne sua hemɔ, ye nyemene!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nnaa ɛmɔ anwu sɔ sua mbiri-mbiri hemɔ? Ɔtte nikye bɛ bɛkɔyakyi nyɔboɛ wɔ nyɔboɛ so wɔ wa ɔ. Bɛkɔdwiri ye mukoraati bɛkogua.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu te Olive bokaa naso ne, né ye nye tua asɔre awuro ne, na Petro, Yakobo, Yohane, ne Andrea wale ye berɛ kokoanu, yeɛ bɛbisale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Ka kyire yɛ, kyinzu yeɛ ɛhemɔ kosi ɔ? Na nzu yeɛ ɔkɔmaa yɛkonwu kyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ baasisi ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yeti, Yesu hyɛle yebo ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔnea yé na ebiala anlaka-laka ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Mmeni pee kɔfa me dumaa kɔwa kɔɔha kyɛ, ‘Me yeɛ nne ye,’ na bɛkɔlaka-laka mmeni pee. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Afei koso, sɛ ɛmɔte koɛ ne koɛ nwo dwirɛ a, nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ; odikyɛ sɔ nningyein hemɔ sisi, nakoso né awieɛ ne nnya walle. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Na maen kɔdwɔso kotia maen, ná ahennie adwɔso atia ahennie, aseɛ wosolɛ kosi nekaa ahoroɛ, na ɛhɔen kɔwa. Ɛhemɔ te aworɛ nu yealɛ né ahyɛaseɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé, ofikyɛ mmenia kɔfa ɛmɔ kɔhɔ kɔɔto, na me ti, bɛkogwa ɛmɔ wɔ sua bɔ beyia nu nanu, na bɛkɔfa ɛmɔ bɛkɔhɔ amrado ne ahemvo nyunu, ná wayɛ adanzeɛ wama bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Na odikyɛ bɛdi moa bɛka nzɛmba ne bɛkyire maen-maen namukoraati. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Na sɛ bɛkye ɛmɔ, na bɛkwaaye ɛmɔ bɛma a, nnɛmɔ dwene bɔ ɛmɔkɔha nwo, mmom bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔma ɛmɔ sɔ mmerɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɛmɔha ɔ. Ofikyɛ nná ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ kodwudwo ɔ, mmom honhom krongron ne. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Aliemaa kɔye oliema kɔma maa bɛkɔhu ye, baba kɔye ɔwa kɔma, na ngwalaa kɔdwɔso kotia b'awofo, na bɛkɔmaa bɛkɔhu bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Na me dumaa ti, ebiala kɔtane ɛmɔ, nakoso, bɔ okomia ye nye kogyina nu koodwu awieɛ ne, ye yeɛ okonya ngoa ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Na sɛ ɛmɔnwu akyiwadeɛ bɔ ɔbɔ maen ne kyɛ ogyi nekaa bɔ ɔnzɛ kyɛ ogyina ne a (odikyɛ bɔ ɔkenga ne te yebo), ye de ɛmɔma bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Yudea ne nwati hɔ mmokaa so. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Nnɛmaa bɔ ɔte sua tiafia ne dwu ase kyɛ ɔbaafa nikye fi ye awuro. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Na bɔ wahɔ fiɛso ne, nnɛmaa ɔba awuro kyɛ ɔbaafa ye atadeɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Bɛ bɔ bɛnwonzɛ, ne bɛ bɔ bɛma ngwalaa nyɔfone ne de, bɛ yaakɔ! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ, na ɛhe anzi ayirɛ mmerɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ofikyɛ ahohiehia bɔ ɔkɔwa sɔ mmerɛ ne, ofi mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ bɔle wiase bɔ ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sɔ mmerɛ ne,” kyire kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ahohiehia ne kɔwa ne. </char></note> ne, ebie wale lle, na ye si ne, kõ nngɔwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Sɛ Awurade ambɛ ngyẽa naso a, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ okonya ngoa ɔ, nakoso, bɛ bɔ waye bɛ nati, ɔkɔpɛ ngyẽa naso. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, sɛ ebie ka kyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔnea, Kristo ne wɔ wa,’ anaa ‘Nea, ye yeɛ ɔwɔ dɔ ne’ a, nnɛmɔ dɛ́ bɛdi. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Ofikyɛ ngondombo Kristo ne ngondombo adiifoɛ pee kɔwa, bɛkɔyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ pee, na sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé a, bɛkɔlaka-laka bɛ bɔ baye bɛ ne po. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ. Mali moa maha ɛhe mahyire ɛmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Na sɔ ngyẽa nanu ne, ahohiehia ne si ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">‘eyia ne kɔkakyi awosii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">ɛsraen ne ngɔta.<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Na nzramaa kofi anwuro kɔtete kogua ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">na bɛkɔwoso anwuro anwoserɛ.’<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Afei, bɛkonwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne ba, na ɔnate munungum nu bɔ ole tumi paa ne anuonyam. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Na ɔkɔsoma ye abɔfo maa bɛkɔboɔboa bɛ bɔ baye bɛ ne noa bɛkofi mvrama nna nanu, fi anwuro noa koodwu anwuro noa.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Afei, ɛmɔsua ɛhe bɛfi borɔdoma bakaa ne berɛ: Sɛ onya fa nyaa a, ɛmɔse kyɛ, ɔngɔhyɛ ne ahuhuro awa. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔnwu kyɛ nningyein hemɔ sisi a, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ wadwu anoa ne si pɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, sɔ aworɛ ndoɔtoasoɛ ne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sɔ mmenia ne.”</char></note> nngɔpɛ nu, sana nningyein he amukoraati awa nu kora. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Anwuro ne aseɛ kɔpɛ nu, nakoso me dwirɛ ne de, ɔngɔpɛ nu lle.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Na kyẽa ne né dɔnhwere ne de, ebiala nze, abɔfo bɔ bɛwɔ anwuro ne Baa ne po nze, Baba ne ngome yeɛ ɔse ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ɛmɔla ɛmɔ nwo so, na ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnze mmerɛ bɔ bahyɛ ne. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ɔte kyɛ biaa bie bɔ otu atee, na ɔfale ye awuro wurale ye ngoaa sa, ɔfale ebiala adwuma mane ye, yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɔ ɔte anoa nanwo ne kyɛ, ɔmaa ye nye la berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Yeti, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnze mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ wura ne kɔwa ɔ; kyɛ ɔkɔwa nnɔsoa anaa kɔngɔen, alobahene anaa ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />ná wamma amvu ɛmɔ nu, wannwu kyɛ ɛmɔ ala. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Na bɔ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ne, meka mekyire ebiala: Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Né waha ɛlɛnyɔ maa bɛdi Pɛnu ne Paanoo Bɔ Yiste Nne Nu Afahyɛ ne. Né sɔfo mbanyi ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ pena atee bɔ bɛkɔfa so bɛkɔhye Yesu kodɛɛ, ná bahu ye. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Na bɛhane kyɛ: “Yɛngɔyɛ ye wɔ afahyɛ nabo, wanyɛ sɔ a, mmenia ne kɔyɛ basabasa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu didi wɔ kwataniɛ Simon awuro wɔ Betania ne, maame bie wale berɛ, né otira alabasta towaa bɔ ngoo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okyire “Lafenta”—Ɔte nikye bɔ bɛfa bɛgua bɛ nwo maa bɛ nwo bo fona.</char></note> wɔ nu, nardo ngoo fona-fona bɔ ye nyɔboɛ yɛ se. Otuli so, na ohwie guale Yesu ti anu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bɔ ɔyɛ ne, né ɔyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne bie ahi, yeti bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛsɛkye ngoo ne? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ahaa ɛkɔhora kɔtɔne sɔ ngoo fona-fona he konya dɛnare 300, na afa ama ahiafoɛ.” Bɛfɛle ye so yaa paa.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛ dwudwole ye paa.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Nakoso Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔyakyi ye, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔha ye ne? Bɔ wayɛ wama me ne, ɔte piri paa. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ahiafoɛ de, daa bɛne ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛwɔ wa ɔ, ná ɛmɔ kɔhora bɛkɔyɛ bɛ pa, nakoso me de, ɛmɔngonya me daa. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Wayɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora ɔ, wafa ngoo fona-fona he wagua me nwo wafa wasiesie me nipadua ne wama kyẽa bɔ bɛkosie me ne. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Na meka kyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, nekaa biala bɔ bɛkɔha nzɛmba ne wɔ wiase amukoraati ne, bɔ braa he ayɛ ne, bɛkɔha bɛkɔkaye ye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Na Yuda Iskariot, bɔ ɔte buru-ne-nyɔ nanu kõ ne hɔle sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ berɛ kyɛ ɔkwaaye Yesu ma bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛtele ɛhe ne, bɛ nye gyele, na bɛhyɛle ye bɔ kyɛ bɛkɔma ye sikaa. Yeti, ɔhyɛle yebo penane atee bɔ ɔkɔfa so kɔye ye kɔma ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Afei, kyẽa bɔ oli moa bɔ bɛdi Paanoo Bɔ Yiste Nne Nu ne, kyẽa bɔ bɛfa Pɛnu boan ne bɛbɔ afɔleɛ ne, ye asuafoɛ ne bisale ye kyɛ: “Nisua yeɛ ɛpena kyɛ yɛsiesie maa ɛdi Pɛnu ne?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yeti ɔsomane asuafoɛ nanu nyɔ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ kuro nanu, biaa bie bɔ ɔsõ bua koyia ɛmɔ, ɛmɔli ye si. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Awuro biala bɔ okowura nu ne, ɛmɔha behyire efiewura ne kyɛ, ‘Kyerɛkyerɛniɛ ne nwa yɛbisa wɔ kyɛ: “Ɛwɔfoɛ sua bɔ mene m'asuafoɛ nemɔ koli Pɛnu ne wɔ nu ne, ɔwɔ nisua?” ’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Na okohyire ɛmɔ aborosaen sua kandinga bie bɔ basiesie nu kama, ɛmɔsiesie Pɛnu ne wɔ berɛ ma yɛɛli.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Yeti, asuafoɛ nemɔ fili berɛ hɔle kuro nanu, na kyɛbɔ ɔhane ne, sɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ yeɛ bɛnwuni ye ɔ, na bɛsiesiele Pɛnu ne.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Odwuli nnɔsoa ne, Yesu ne buru-ne-nyɔ ne wale. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Na bɛte tɛbulu nanwo bɛdidi ne, Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ.”</char></note> ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ ne me didi ne, ɛmɔ nu kõ kɔye me kɔma.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Edwirɛ ne yɛle bɛ yea, na bɛbisale ye ngoko-ngoko kyɛ: “Me anaa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɔte buru-ne-nyɔ nanu kõ, bɔ ɔne me to asaa didi wɔ kyɛnzee kõ anu ne. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Sona Awa ne kɔ kyɛbɔ bahworɔ bafa ye nwo ne, nakoso, bɔ ɔkɔye Sona Awa ne kɔma ne, ye yaakɔ! Sɛ banwo ye po a, ahaa ɔte pa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Na mmerɛ bɔ bɛguso bɛdidi ne, Yesu fale paanoo, na ohyirale so yiele ne, obuli nu fa mane ye asuafoɛ nemɔ hane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔle, ɛhe gyi berɛ ma me nipadua ne.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Afei ɔfale kwangoa, na ɔlale ase yiele ne, ɔfa mane bɛ, na bɛ mukoraati bɛnone ye noa. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛhe gyi berɛ ma me ‘mogya bɔ bɛfa bɛyɛ apam ne,’ me mogya bɔ bɛkɔhwie bɛkogua bɛkɔma mmeni pee ne. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nahorɛ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, mengɔno bobe nzãa kõ, kodwu kyẽa bɔ ngɔno ye foforɛ wɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nu ne.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Na bɛtole ayɛyie dwein bɛyiele ne, bɛhɔle Olive Bokaa naso. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeɛ Yesu ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ ɔkɔto me nnɔsoa he ne, ɔkɔto ɛmɔ mukoraati sintidua, ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Ngopira bɔ ɔnea mmoan ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">na mmoan namukoraati kɔbɔ kɔsande.<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Nakoso bɛtingye me a, ngoli ɛmɔ nyunu ngɔhɔ Galilea.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petro hane kyɛ: “Sɛ ɔkɔto bɛ mukoraati sintidua po a, me de, ongosi lle.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu ha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nahorɛ, meka mekyire wɔ kyɛ, kɔngɔen he, kyɛ dee bɔ akɔ bɔ pɛn-nyɔ ne, né aha ye pɛn-nza kyɛ ɛnze me.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Nakoso Petro sa hane ye bieku kyɛ: “Sɛ odikyɛ mene wɔ wu po a, mengɔha ye lle kyɛ menze wɔ.” Na bɛ mukoraati bɛhane sɔ ala.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Afei, bɛwale nekaa bɔ bɛfrɛ berɛ Getsemane, na Yesu ha hyirele ye asuafoɛ ne kyɛ: “Ɛmɔtena wa ma ngɔmmɔ mbaeɛ mmera.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Na ɔfale Petro, Yakobo ne Yohane, na ye wora hyɛle yebo bɔle, na ɔyɛle basaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Me wora abɔ pa-pa, ɔfa me kɔ ewue nu po. Ɛmɔtena ɛwa, na ɛmɔ ne me nwondɛ.” <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ ne me si pɛ.”</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ɔhɔle anyunu kaa ne, obutuli berɛ bɔle mbaeɛ kyɛ sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé a, ahaa sɔ mmerɛ ne sã ye nwo. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Na ɔhane kyɛ: “<char style="tl">Abba,</char><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kyire “O Baba.”</char></note> Baba, ɛkora yɛ nikye biala. Ye kwangoa he fi me so, nakoso nná bɔ mekuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ, mmom bɔ ekuro yeɛ ɔyɛ berɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Mmerɛ bɔ ɔwale ne, né bɛ mukoraati badeda, yeɛ obisale Petro kyɛ: “Simon, ɛmɔda? Ɛmɔ angora ne me anzi pɛ dɔnhwere komapɛ po? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔhɔ so bɛbɔ mbaeɛ, ná ɛmɔ angɔ nzɔhwɛ nu. Honhom ne de, okuro, nakoso anwoɔnaen ne yɛ mmerɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Osa ɔɔbɔle mbaeɛ hane edwirɛ komapɛ nala. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Osa wale ne, né bala, ofikyɛ ne bɛ nye kõ. Na né bɛnnwu edwirɛ bɔ bɛha bɛ hyire ye po. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Yesu hɔle ye pɛn-nza so wale ne, ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Sɔ mmerɛ he yeɛ ɛmɔda bedɛ ɛmɔ nwomeɛ ɔ? Wayɛ yé! Mmerɛ naso! Ɛmɔnea, bɛye Sona Awa ne bɛwura abɔnefoɛ sa. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ɛmɔ dwɔso, ɛmɔma yɛhɔ. Bɔ ɔkɔye me kɔma ne awa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Na ogu so odwudwo ne, Yuda bɔ ɔboka buru-ne-nyɔ naso ne wale, né mmeni pee li ye si bɔ bɛtire-tira dadeɛ ne mmo-kuro-mma. Sɔfo mbanyi, atwerɛfoɛ, ne mbanyi nemɔ yeɛ bɛsomane bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Né bɔ ɔbaaye ye ma ne ama bɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ bie kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ngɔfe ye noa ne, ye ane; ɛmɔhye ye, na ɛmɔsɔ yenu yé bɛfa ye bɛhɔ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yeti ɔhɔle Yesu nwo berɛ tee, yeɛ ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Rabi,” na ɔfele ye noa. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Na bɛɛsɔle ye nu bɛhyele ye. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛgyi berɛ nanu kõ yele ye dadeɛ, ná ɔfa pɛle sɔfo ne akoaa ne so. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu bisale mmenia ne kyɛ: “Dadeɛ ne mmo-kuro-mma yeɛ ɛmɔ afa bawa me so, kyɛ ɛmɔ baahye awieniɛ bie ne? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Daa biala, né metena asɔre awuro berɛ mekyirekyire, nakoso ɛmɔ angye me. Mmom bɔ wasi ne amaa tworɔnzɛm ne awa nu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Na asuafoɛ namukoraati nwati yakyile ye.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Né abrandeɛ bie li Yesu si, ná nwera ngome yeɛ ne wafa wakata ye nwo ɔ. Ahaa bɛkye ye, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />nakoso oyakyile nwera ne mane bɛ fale ye nwo tole so hɔle.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Afei bɛfale Yesu bɛɛmane sɔfo panyi ne; na sɔfo mbanyi, kuro nanu mbanyi, ne atwerɛfoɛ namukoraati yiale nu. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Nakoso Petro lili ye si ngaka-ngaka hɔle sɔfo panyi ne awuro berɛ, na ɔɔtenane asomvoɛ nemɔ nwo berɛ kyɛ ɔto see. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Afei, né sɔfo mbanyi ne Sanhendrin namukoraati pena adanzeɛ bɔ bɛkogyina so bɛkɔhu Yesu ɔ, nakoso, bannya bie. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Ɔwɔ nu, mmeni pee lili adanzeɛ tiale ye, nakoso né bɛ adanzeɛ ne nyia. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Na ebiemɔ dwɔso lili adanzeɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ tiale ye kyɛ: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Yɛtele kyɛ ɔka kyɛ, ‘Ngɔdwiri asɔre awuro bɔ bɛfale bɛ sa bɛsili ne ngogua, na ngɔfa ɛlɛsa ngosi foforɛ, ɛhene de nná asaa yeɛ bɛfa bɛsili ɔ.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Nakoso ɛhe anu po ne, bɛ adanzeɛ ne anyia. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Yeti, sɔfo panyi ne dwɔso gyinane bɛ afia, na obisale Yesu kyɛ: “Yeti, ɛngɔ dwudwo? Edwirɛ nwora bɔ bɛka bɛgua wɔ so ne, ɛtelle?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Nakoso Yesu yɛle dinn, wammukye ye noa. Sɔfo Panyi ne sa bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ɛle Kristo ne, Bɔ Bahyira Ye né awa ne anaa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu hane kyɛ: “Yoo, me ane. Na ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ Sona Awa ne te Otumvoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɔ ole Tumi ne.”</char></note> ne sa famaa so, na ɔnate munungum nu wɔ anwuro ɔba.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Sɔfo panyi ne tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, osunzuale ye atadeɛ nu, na ɔhane kyɛ: “Adanzeɛ beni bieku yeɛ yɛhia ɔ? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Nnaa ɛmɔ ate mmusue dwirɛ bɔ waha ne. Nzu yeɛ ɛmɔka bɛfa ye nwo ɔ?” Na bɛ mukoraati bɛbule ye fɔ kyɛ, odikyɛ owu. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Na ebiemɔ hyɛle yebo tetele ngɔserɛ guale ye nyunu, na bɛfale nikye bɛkatale ye ti, yeɛ bɛbobɔle ye kunu. Na bɛha bɛhyirele ye kyɛ: “Hyɛ ngɔm!” Na asomvoɛ nemɔ bobɔle ye nye so, na bɛfale ye bɛhɔle.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Né Petro wɔ aseɛ nwo dɔ, wɔ sɔfo panyi ne aluo berɛ, na sɔfo panyi né afaneɛ kõ wale berɛ, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />onwuni kyɛ Petro to see ne, ɔneane ye haa yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ: “Wɔ koso, né ɛboka Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu so.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Nakoso, ɔsale ye wɔ bɛ mukoraati nyunu kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ɛka ye dwirɛ ne, menze ye, na mende bɔ ɛka ne bo po.” Na ofili berɛ hɔle anoa ne nyunu dɔ.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ ne biemɔ nu a, bafa edwirɛ bie batoa so wa kyɛ: “</char><char style="em">Na akɔ bɔle.</char>”</note> <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Afaneɛ ne sa nwuni ye wɔ berɛ, na ɔha hyirele bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne kyɛ: “Sɔ bia he boka bɛ so.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Nakoso, ɔsale bieku. Ɔyɛle kaa ne, bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne bie sa ha hyire Petro kyɛ: “Ɔte nahorɛ, ɛboka bɛ so, na ɛte Galileaniɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Na ɔhyɛle yebo lili amoen hane ndaen kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ɛmɔka ye nwo dwirɛ ne, menze ye!” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Na ɛberɛ ala, akɔ sa bɔle. Na Petro kayele edwirɛ bɔ Yesu ha hyirele ye ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Kyɛ dee bɔ akɔ bɔ pɛn-nyɔ ne, né aha ye pɛn-nza kyɛ ɛnze me.” Na otikyele esuɛ nu.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu ne, sɔfo mbanyi, kuro nanu mbanyi, atwerɛfoɛ ne Sanhendrin namukoraati yiale nu fale adwene, na bɛkyekyele Yesu sa, yeɛ bɛfale ye bɛɛmane Pilato ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Yeɛ Pilato bisale ye kyɛ: “Wɔ yeɛ ele Yudafoɛ hene ne?” Yesu hane kyɛ: “Ye ala yeɛ aha ne.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Nakoso sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ bɔle ye kwaadu pee. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Yeɛ Pilato sa bisale ye bieku kyɛ: “Ɛngɔ dwudwo? Nea edwirɛ nwora bɔ bɛka bɛgua wɔ so ɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Na bɔ ɔyɛle Pilato nwanwa ne, Yesu ammukye ye noa.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Bɛdi afahyɛ biala a, né Pilato yakyi bɛ bɔ bɛla prizin nanu kõ, ebiala bɔ mmenia ne kuro ne. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Barabas ne mmenia biemɔ bɔ bɛpena kyɛ bɛtu awaen ne la prizin, né sɔ mmenia hemɔ ali bɔne paa. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Yeti mmeni lɔen ne fo wale berɛ, na bɛsrɛle Pilato kyɛ, bɔ ɔtaa yɛ ne, ɔyɛ bieku ma bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Yeti Pilato bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nyakyi Yudafoɛ hene ne mma ɛmɔ anaa?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ofikyɛ né ɔse kyɛ ahoɔyaa ti yeɛ sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ afa Yesu abrɛ ye ne. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Nakoso, sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ tutu guale mmenia ne soanu kyɛ, bɛha kyɛ bɛkuro Barabas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Yeɛ Pilato bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Ye de, Bɔ ɛmɔfrɛ ye Yudafoɛ hene ne, nzu yeɛ mva nyɛ ye ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Na bɛteane nu kyɛ: “Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Yeɛ Pilato bisale bɛ kyɛ: “Nzu ɔ? Bɔne beni yeɛ wayɛ ɔ?” Nakoso bɛteɛteane nu serɛ-serɛ kyɛ: “Bɔ ye asɛnnua nu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Na ɔnate kyɛ né Pilato pena kyɛ ɔyɛ bɔ mmenia ne kuro ma bɛ nati, ɔyakyile Barabas mane bɛ. Na ɔmaa bɛgwale Yesu, bɛyiele ne, ɔfale ye mane bɛ kyɛ bɛɛbɔ ye asɛnnua nu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Ná sogyafoɛ nemɔ fale ye fili berɛ hɔle amrado n'awuro, na bɛfrɛle sogyafoɛ namukoraati bɛwale berɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bɛfale atadeɛ <char style="tl">valent</char> <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Brɔfo “</char><char style="it">Purple</char>”</note> bɛwurale ye, na bɛfale mmowie bɛyɛle kyerɛ bɛwurale ye ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Na bɛhyɛle yebo bɛ momane ye kyɛ: “Yudafoɛ hene, wɔ ngoa so oo.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Afei, bɛfale elemmire bɛfifini ye ti anu, na bɛtetele ngɔserɛ bɛguale ye nyunu. Bɛyiele ne, bɛkotole ye. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Bɛgorole ye nwo bɛyiele ne, bɛyele atadeɛ <char style="tl">valent</char> ne, na bɛfale ye bɔbɔ ye atadeɛ bɛwurale ye. Yeɛ bɛfale ye bɛhɔle kyɛ bɛkwaabɔ ye asɛnnua nu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Né Alɛzanda ne Rufu baba Simon bɔ ofi Kiren né nate atee naso ɔba kuro nanu, sogyafoɛ nemɔ nwuni ye ne, bɛhyɛle ye maa ɔsoale Yesu asɛnnua ne. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bɛfale Yesu bɛwale nekaa bie, bɛfrɛ berɛ Golgota, yebo kyire “Tire Kokuroka.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Ɛwa yeɛ bɛfale nzãa bɔ bafa kurobo bafra bɛmane ye ne, nakoso wanno. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Afei bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu. Na bɛhyɛle ye atadeɛ nanu, na bɛtɔɔsole<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛbɔle ndondo.”</char></note> bɛneane bɔ odikyɛ ebiala fa ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu ne, né ɔte kɔyɛ ngyerɛmɔ 9:00.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">9:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so nza</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Na bɛhworɔle ye kwaadu ne bɛbɔle ye ti afia kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">“YUDAFOƐ HENE NE.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bɛbɔle awiefoɛ nyɔ asɛnnua nu bɛbokale ye so, né kõ wɔ ye famaa, yeɛ né kõ wɔ ye bɛen. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, edwirɛ bie wura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bdit">Na ɛhe maa tworɔnzɛm ne wale nu kyɛ, “Bɛhale ye bɛfrale mmeratofoɛ.”</char> Nakoso sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa, ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, sɔ dwirɛ ne nne nu.</note>— <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Na bɛ bɔ bɛpɛ nu ne wosole bɛ ti, na bɛdwudwo betiale ye kyɛ: “Nea, wɔ yeɛ ɛnwa ɛkodwiri asɔre awuro ne kogua, na afa ɛlɛsa asi ne? <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Dɛ́ wɔ nwo fi asɛnnua naso, na dwu ase.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Sɔ ala yeɛ sɔfo mbanyi nemɔ ne atwerɛfoɛ nemɔ gorole ye nwo kyɛ: “Odɛ́ amanvoɛ, nakoso ɔngora nne ye nwo. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ɛmɔma Kristo ne, Israelfoɛ hene ne dwu fi asɛnnua naso ma yɛnwu ye, na yɛkole ye yɛkoli.” Na bɛ bɔ babɔ bɛ asɛnnua nu baboka ye so ne po dwudwo tiale ye.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Na ofi eyia 12:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">12:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔto so nzia.</char></note> bɔ ɔkwadwu eyia 3:00<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">3:00 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne te dɔnhwere bɔ ɔtɔ so ngona.</char></note> ne, aseɛ naso mukoraati yɛle tumm. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ná ɔbɔle 3:00 ne, Yesu teane nu kyɛ: <char style="tl">“Eli, Eli, lama sabaktani?”</char> Yebo kyire kyɛ: “Me Nyameɛ, me Nyameɛ, nzuati yeɛ aye wɔ nye ama me ne?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛ bɔ bɛgyigyi berɛ ne tele sɔ dwirɛ ne, bɛhane kyɛ: “Ɛmɔtie, ɔfrɛ Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Na ebie tuli mirika fale eminaen bɔle nza bɔ enu ka nu, ná ɔfa tuale elemmire noa fa mane ye kyɛ ɔno, na ɔhane kyɛ, “Ɛmɔyakyi ye. Ɛmɔma yɛnea sɛ Elia kɔɔye ye kofi asɛnnua naso a.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Na Yesu teane nu, yeɛ olɛle nwomeɛ bɔ ɔpɛ ye bo. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Na <char style="w" lemma="Kɛtens ">kɛtens</char> bɔ ɔwɔ nekaa krongron berɛ nanu tele nyɔ fili anwuro oosili ase. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mmerɛ bɔ sogyaniɛ panyi bɔ ogyi Yesu nyunu berɛ ne nwuni nningyein bɔ osisi, ɔne kyɛbɔ olɛle nwomeɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, ɔhane kyɛ: “Amba, sɔ biaa he te Nyameɛ awa.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Né mmrasua biemɔ gyi nekaa bie bɛnea bɔ ɔkɔ so ne. Bɛ nu biemɔ yeɛ ole Mary Magdalene, Yakobo kamba ne Yose maame Mary, yeɛ Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Né sɔ mmrasua nemɔ taa di Yesu si wɔ Galilea, na né bɛsõ ye; né mmrasua pee boka bɛ so, bɛne Yesu yeɛ bɛhɔle Yerusalem ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Né aleɛ pena sã, na ɔnate kyɛ né ɔte Anwoboaboa Kyẽa (kyire kyɛ, kyẽa bɔ oli Homeda ne nyunu) nati, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosef bɔ ofi Arimatea ne nyane akukuduro hɔle Pilato berɛ, na ɔsrɛle ye kyɛ ɔfa Yesu fuin ne ma ye; né Yosef te Sanhendrin badwa nanuniɛ bɔ mmenia bu ye paa, na ne ɔnwondɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne koso. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Mmerɛ bɔ Pilato tele kyɛ Yesu awu ne, ɔyɛle ye nwanwa, yeti ɔfrɛle sogyaniɛ panyi ne bisale kyɛ Yesu awu amba a. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Mmerɛ bɔ sogyaniɛ ne hane kyɛ wawu ne, ɔfale fuin ne mane Yosef. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yeti Yosef tɔle nwera pa, na ɔyele Yesu fuin ne fili asɛnnua naso, yeɛ ɔfale nwera ne kyekyele ye nwo. Na ɔfale ye tole asieleɛ bɔ bapɛ ye wɔ nyɔboɛ bie nu, na omununi nyɔboɛ tole ye noa. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Nakoso, Mary Magdalene ne Yose maame Mary nwuni nekaa bɔ bɛfale ye bɛtole ne.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Homeda ne si ne, Mary Magdalene, Yakobo maame Mary, ne Salome tɔle ayire kyɛ bɛfa bɛkɔpopa Yesu fuin ne. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Na dapɛn né kyẽa bɔ oli moa ne, bɛhɔle asieleɛ naso ngyerɛmɔ tutuutu, bekye bɔ né eyia ne afite ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Na ne bɛ bisa bɛ nwo kyɛ: “Nwa yeɛ ɔkɔmunu nyɔboɛ ne kofi asieleɛ ne noa kɔma yɛ ɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nakoso, bɛtole bɛ nye ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ baye nyɔboɛ ne bafi berɛ, ɔwɔ nu, né ɔte piri paa. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bɛwurale asieleɛ nanu ne, bɛnwuni kyɛ abrandeɛ bie wura atadeɛ fufue hyɛnn te asieleɛ ne famaa so. Ná bɛ kunu tele bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Yeɛ ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ. Nnaa ɛmɔpena Nazerɛtniɛ Yesu bɔ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu ne. Ɔnne wa, watingye. Ɛmɔnea, ɛwa yeɛ bɛfale ye bɛtole ne. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ɛmɔhɔ, na ɛmɔha behyire ye asuafoɛ nemɔ ne Petro kyɛ, ‘Odi ɛmɔ nyunu moa kɔ Galilea.’ Na kyɛbɔ maha mahyire ɛmɔ ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ ɛmɔ konwu ye ɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ mmrasua nemɔ fili asieleɛ naso ne, né bɛ nwo woso-woso bɛ, na né esuronyi aha bɛ. Ná bannga hwee bangyire ebiala, ofikyɛ né bɛsuro paa.</para>
  <para style="iex" vid="MRK 16:8">Sɛ ɛnea tete asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa ɔne bɔ odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, Marko yeti 16 ne si ngyekyɛmue 8 pɛ. Nakoso asaanoa ndworɔyɛ ne biemɔ wɔ berɛ a, bafa AWIEƐ DWIRƐ SII batoa ngyekyɛmue 8 naso, yeɛ ebiemɔ koso afa AWIEƐ DWIRƐ TENDEE batoa so fi ngyekyɛmue 9 kosi 20.</para>
  <para style="s2" vid="MRK 16:8">AWIEƐ DWIRƐ SII</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 16:8">
    <char style="em">Edwirɛ bɔ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ ne, bɛbɔle ye mua bɛhyirele Petro ne bɛ bɔ ɔne bɛ wɔ berɛ ne. Ɛhene si ne, Yesu Kristo bɔbɔ somane bɛ kyɛ, bɛɛha daa ngoa nwo dwirɛ krongron bɔ ɔmborɔ ne bɛfi afiteleɛ beedwu atɔleɛ.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s2">AWIEƐ DWIRƐ TENDEE</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />
    <char style="em">Mmerɛ bɔ Yesu tingyele, wɔ dapɛn ne kyẽa bɔ oli moa ne, ɔyele ye nwo ali ndɛ hyirele Mary Magdalene, ye yeɛ otuli sunzummɔne nzoo fili ye nu ne.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" /><char style="em">Na bɛ bɔ né ɔne bɛ wɔ berɛ, bɔ né bɛsu bɛpɛ awuye ne, ɔɔbɔle bɛ amaneɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" /><char style="em">Nakoso, bɛtele kyɛ Yesu atingye, ná wanwu ye ne, banne banni.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />
    <char style="em">Ɛhene si ne, mmerɛ bɔ bɛ nu nyɔ nate atee so bɛkɔ nnamue bie nu ne, Yesu yele ye nwo ali wɔ tebea foforɛ nu hyirele bɛ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" /><char style="em">Na bɛsale bɛ si bɛɛbɔle bɛ ngaa ne amaneɛ, na bɛ koso, banne bɛ banni.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />
    <char style="em">Yesi ne, mmerɛ bɔ buru-ne-kõ ne te tɛbulu nwo bɛdidi ne, Yesu yele ye nwo ali hyirele bɛ, na gyidie bɔ bannya ye, ɔne b'ahone bɔ ɔyɛ se nati, ohwili bɛ nyunu, ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛnwuni kyɛ watingye ne, banne bɛ banni.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />
    <char style="em">Na ɔha hyirele bɛ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔhɔ wiase mukoraati, na ɛmɔha nzɛmba ne behyire abɔdeɛ mukoraati.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><char style="em">Ebiala bɔ okole koli maa bɛkɔbɔ ye asu ne, okonya ngoa, na ebiala bɔ wanne wanni ne, bɛkobu ye fɔ.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><char style="em">Na bɛ bɔ bɛkole bɛkoli ne, nzɛngyerɛneɛ hemɔ koli bɛ si: bɛkɔfa me dumaa bɛkɔtu sunzummɔne, bɛkɔha dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ,</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><char style="em">bɛkɔfa bɛ sa bɛkɔma ɛwoo so, na sɛ bɛno pɔizen po a, ɔngɔyɛ bɛ hwee. Bɛkɔfa bɛ sa bɛkogua bɛ bɔ bafokyɛ so maa bɛ nwo kɔtɔ bɛ.”</char><verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <char style="em">Na Awurade Yesu dwudwo hyirele bɛ yiele ne, bɛfale ye bɛhɔle anwuro, na ɔɔtenane Nyameɛ sa famaa so.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" /><char style="em">Na bɛ de, bɛɛhane nzɛmba ne wɔ nekaa biala, na mmerɛ bɔ Awurade ne bɛ yɛ adwuma ne, ɔmaa bɛyɛle nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɛfa bɛfoale edwirɛ naso. </char><verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>